(280327, 19763, 4267, '<td valign="top">great composition and capture of emotion... a touch faster shutter will help capture the motion....</td>', 'great composition and capture of emotion... a touch faster shutter will help capture the motion....', '2003-04-28 01:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(280331, 19302, 4267, '<td valign="top">way cool....  especially the front and rear shots... for the fender shot I might have tried a higher angle that showed the steering wheel and some of the interior as well</td>', 'way cool....  especially the front and rear shots... for the fender shot I might have tried a higher angle that showed the steering wheel and some of the interior as well', '2003-04-28 01:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280336, 19765, 4267, '<td valign="top">all three are well done and work in unison together...</td>', 'all three are well done and work in unison together...', '2003-04-28 01:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(280339, 19059, 6855, '<td valign="top">adorable!</td>', 'adorable!', '2003-04-28 01:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(280340, 19553, 6855, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!</td>', 'gorgeous!', '2003-04-28 01:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(280344, 19662, 2344, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea and it''s very well executed. However, the challenge description clearly says 3 different photographs, while this is 1 photograph cut into 3. I would have also lightened this up a tad.  Be proud and hang this on the wall cuz it''s very nice!</td>', 'I really like this idea and it''s very well executed. However, the challenge description clearly says 3 different photographs, while this is 1 photograph cut into 3. I would have also lightened this up a tad.  Be proud and hang this on the wall cuz it''s very nice!', '2003-04-28 01:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(280350, 19358, 2344, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, however the challenge desc. says 3 different photographs. This is one photograph cut up and arranged back together. I really love this idea and it''s very well done except for the line going through the baby''s nose.</td>', 'This is very nice, however the challenge desc. says 3 different photographs. This is one photograph cut up and arranged back together. I really love this idea and it''s very well done except for the line going through the baby''s nose.', '2003-04-28 01:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(280357, 19674, 2344, '<td valign="top">Oh Canada?! with labatt blue and molson export?!?! Where''s the MOLSON CANADIAN?!   If you were to print this out I"d suggest making the white boxes even (it''s just a small nitpick) and your Moosehead bottle looks like it''s tilted.  Great idea.. I was just thinking to myself.. we sure dont see much beer on DPC...</td>', 'Oh Canada?! with labatt blue and molson export?!?! Where''s the MOLSON CANADIAN?!   If you were to print this out I"d suggest making the white boxes even (it''s just a small nitpick) and your Moosehead bottle looks like it''s tilted.  Great idea.. I was just thinking to myself.. we sure dont see much beer on DPC...', '2003-04-28 01:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280358, 19569, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, the presentation is wonderful, with the Kanji which a nice added touch. I feel that the top right picture, is a little dark but also works as it adds the cirlce. One more thing, I think I would prefer it if the leaf wasn''t cut off.  Overall, this is a great picture. 9</td>', 'I love the idea, the presentation is wonderful, with the Kanji which a nice added touch. I feel that the top right picture, is a little dark but also works as it adds the cirlce. One more thing, I think I would prefer it if the leaf wasn''t cut off.  Overall, this is a great picture. 9', '2003-04-28 01:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(280369, 19695, 509, '<td valign="top">As an avid Star Wars fan, I love this idea.  That said, I think it would be more interesting with an opponent in one of the frames.  If not that, than some motion blur on the saber from the first position to the second (probably hard to do in photoshop though, since the lightsaber is yet to be invented....yet = )</td>', 'As an avid Star Wars fan, I love this idea.  That said, I think it would be more interesting with an opponent in one of the frames.  If not that, than some motion blur on the saber from the first position to the second (probably hard to do in photoshop though, since the lightsaber is yet to be invented....yet = )', '2003-04-28 01:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(280370, 19768, 806, '<td valign="top">very very  cool!</td>', 'very very  cool!', '2003-04-28 01:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(280373, 19769, 806, '<td valign="top">excellent concept.. great presentation</td>', 'excellent concept.. great presentation', '2003-04-28 01:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(280375, 19278, 509, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah Toyota Celica!  Kinda out of place among Porches, but one of my favorite cars nonetheless = )  Nice job</td>', 'Oh yeah Toyota Celica!  Kinda out of place among Porches, but one of my favorite cars nonetheless = )  Nice job', '2003-04-28 01:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280376, 19358, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful. I love the composition and really everything about this. Adorable baby! Good Luck!10</td>', 'This is so beautiful. I love the composition and really everything about this. Adorable baby! Good Luck!10', '2003-04-28 01:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280378, 19579, 806, '<td valign="top">what an incredible concept!!! wonderful!</td>', 'what an incredible concept!!! wonderful!', '2003-04-28 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(280380, 19358, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful image and presentation!</td>', 'beautiful image and presentation!', '2003-04-28 01:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280382, 19716, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful , the composition is beautiful and has a strong impact, I love the curves. The only nit-pick is that the top left image seems a little too grainy.  Good Luck!9</td>', 'This is wonderful , the composition is beautiful and has a strong impact, I love the curves. The only nit-pick is that the top left image seems a little too grainy.  Good Luck!9', '2003-04-28 01:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(280387, 19680, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the progression of the flower from further away to close-up.  The colors are nice and the lighting seems to be equal and even with each picture.  ...And all three of them are well focused.   Since I haven''t voted and critiqued on photos like this before, I hope I''m doing it right.  Anyway, the only thing that bothers me about your triptych is that the top flower is taken at a different angle then the bottom two.  I''m thinking that if it were at the same angle, it would progress a little smoother.  I also might have left out the highlighted border around the individual photos.  Other than those two things, it is a beautiful set.  Congrats.  8  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the progression of the flower from further away to close-up.  The colors are nice and the lighting seems to be equal and even with each picture.  ...And all three of them are well focused.   Since I haven''t voted and critiqued on photos like this before, I hope I''m doing it right.  Anyway, the only thing that bothers me about your triptych is that the top flower is taken at a different angle then the bottom two.  I''m thinking that if it were at the same angle, it would progress a little smoother.  I also might have left out the highlighted border around the individual photos.  Other than those two things, it is a beautiful set.  Congrats.  8  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-28 01:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(280388, 19678, 7748, '<td valign="top">nice idea on border</td>', 'nice idea on border', '2003-04-28 01:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(280391, 19278, 1344, '<td valign="top">Toyota celica a dream car? :)  Recognize the tail in my profile photo?  Anyway, nice idea for the photo.  Would have liked a solid black "platform" instead of what you''re using..    Would have hid the somewhat distracting shadows a little better.  All of the cars look very slightly soft -- maybe more DOF needed.</td>', 'Toyota celica a dream car? :)  Recognize the tail in my profile photo?  Anyway, nice idea for the photo.  Would have liked a solid black "platform" instead of what you''re using..    Would have hid the somewhat distracting shadows a little better.  All of the cars look very slightly soft -- maybe more DOF needed.', '2003-04-28 01:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(280392, 19059, 2125, '<td valign="top">oh that is just super!!!  I hope grandpa gets an 11x14 of this- 10</td>', 'oh that is just super!!!  I hope grandpa gets an 11x14 of this- 10', '2003-04-28 01:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280393, 19766, 4628, '<td valign="top">It would be really good, except the backgruond isnt the same hue in all three images</td>', 'It would be really good, except the backgruond isnt the same hue in all three images', '2003-04-28 01:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(280394, 19579, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is so original and definitely stands out in the crowd. Presentation is fanastic and the colour and toning is great. The only thing I would change is the models expression in the shots, I think that a straight smileless expression would have had more impact. GL</td>', 'This is so original and definitely stands out in the crowd. Presentation is fanastic and the colour and toning is great. The only thing I would change is the models expression in the shots, I think that a straight smileless expression would have had more impact. GL', '2003-04-28 01:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(280395, 19752, 3669, '<td valign="top">LOL...love the humor and your take on the challenge.  There is quite a difference between the front and back of a peacock...that I didn''t realize.  Anyway, I think I would have liked to see the front of the bird as close up as the back of it.  I think you still could have gotten in plenty of the lovely feathers.  Plus, the colors don''t seem to stand out as well.  I really like your idea, though.  Nice set.</td>', 'LOL...love the humor and your take on the challenge.  There is quite a difference between the front and back of a peacock...that I didn''t realize.  Anyway, I think I would have liked to see the front of the bird as close up as the back of it.  I think you still could have gotten in plenty of the lovely feathers.  Plus, the colors don''t seem to stand out as well.  I really like your idea, though.  Nice set.', '2003-04-28 01:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(280396, 19302, 2125, '<td valign="top">would make a great poster!</td>', 'would make a great poster!', '2003-04-28 01:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(280398, 19761, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like your set of pictures, especially the smaller ones.  The larger photo isn''t cropped as close and is also a little fuzzy and grainy.  Alone, it would be okay, but since the other two are nearly perfect, it''s imperfections really stand out.  I like how you grouped your pictures together.</td>', 'I really like your set of pictures, especially the smaller ones.  The larger photo isn''t cropped as close and is also a little fuzzy and grainy.  Alone, it would be okay, but since the other two are nearly perfect, it''s imperfections really stand out.  I like how you grouped your pictures together.', '2003-04-28 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(280402, 19768, 5333, '<td valign="top">I like your work on this on, very creative, but the flaw is you use a plastic balls? for the bubbles, it lacks the rainbow effect it gets from the light.</td>', 'I like your work on this on, very creative, but the flaw is you use a plastic balls? for the bubbles, it lacks the rainbow effect it gets from the light.', '2003-04-28 01:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280403, 19723, 772, '<td valign="top">Arni, you never cease to amaze me... I think this is probably one of the emotionally strongest works in this challenge...  "Pax Vobiscum" :)  = 10 - setzler</td>', 'Arni, you never cease to amaze me... I think this is probably one of the emotionally strongest works in this challenge...  "Pax Vobiscum" :)  = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-28 01:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280404, 19719, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like your take on the challenge.  The only thing that I think would be better is to have the seperate pictures put together in a way where the building is it''s actual size.  Because of the tree and the vehicles parked in front, it becomes distorted.  If they were not there, you wouldn''t be able to tell a difference.  Otherwise, this was a very good idea.  I like the differing colors.</td>', 'I really like your take on the challenge.  The only thing that I think would be better is to have the seperate pictures put together in a way where the building is it''s actual size.  Because of the tree and the vehicles parked in front, it becomes distorted.  If they were not there, you wouldn''t be able to tell a difference.  Otherwise, this was a very good idea.  I like the differing colors.', '2003-04-28 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(280405, 19685, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. I love the colours.</td>', 'Very beautiful. I love the colours.', '2003-04-28 01:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(280406, 19264, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  Awesome colors and fabulous shot.  10.</td>', 'Great subject!  Awesome colors and fabulous shot.  10.', '2003-04-28 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(280407, 19579, 4210, '<td valign="top">This one caught my eye. I think it was an innovative idea!</td>', 'This one caught my eye. I think it was an innovative idea!', '2003-04-28 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(280411, 19719, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great idea - I think I would have liked it better as one ''shot'' cut differently.</td>', 'Great idea - I think I would have liked it better as one ''shot'' cut differently.', '2003-04-28 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(280412, 19619, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Picky point: the top and bottom black boarders are not the same, and the white lines vary in thickness as well.</td>', 'Very nice. Picky point: the top and bottom black boarders are not the same, and the white lines vary in thickness as well.', '2003-04-28 01:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280415, 19710, 4625, '<td valign="top">Cute Idea I like it! Placement of the arm pieces is cool. I wonder how it looked in natural color though? Did it need to be desaturated partly?</td>', 'Cute Idea I like it! Placement of the arm pieces is cool. I wonder how it looked in natural color though? Did it need to be desaturated partly?', '2003-04-28 01:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(280416, 19091, 4625, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I don''t think I would change anything looks great.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I don''t think I would change anything looks great.', '2003-04-28 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(280418, 19280, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh ahgg!  You gots an oops!  Anyway, I love the different takes of the kitty, especially the look on his face in the top left pictures and him playing in the bottom left.  The sepia tone that you used is great and fits for this pictures.  I''m not sure as I like the border around only the outer edges of the individual photos.  Perhaps using it around the background would have been better.  I tell you what...since I like this picture I''m going to ignore the oops at the top of the triptych because I know you didn''t mean to submit it like that.  Good luck in the challenge and I hope you aren''t going to be inundated with "hundreds" of comments about your oops.</td>', 'Oh ahgg!  You gots an oops!  Anyway, I love the different takes of the kitty, especially the look on his face in the top left pictures and him playing in the bottom left.  The sepia tone that you used is great and fits for this pictures.  I''m not sure as I like the border around only the outer edges of the individual photos.  Perhaps using it around the background would have been better.  I tell you what...since I like this picture I''m going to ignore the oops at the top of the triptych because I know you didn''t mean to submit it like that.  Good luck in the challenge and I hope you aren''t going to be inundated with "hundreds" of comments about your oops.', '2003-04-28 01:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(280419, 19620, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the background you used behind all the little pics. Looks great and very fitting.</td>', 'I like the background you used behind all the little pics. Looks great and very fitting.', '2003-04-28 01:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(280421, 19723, 4210, '<td valign="top">A very interesting title. Captures the attention. Not sure exactly what it means, but I kinda get it I think.</td>', 'A very interesting title. Captures the attention. Not sure exactly what it means, but I kinda get it I think.', '2003-04-28 01:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(280423, 19579, 6405, '<td valign="top">Wow, she got some nice parts ,10 from me!</td>', 'Wow, she got some nice parts ,10 from me!', '2003-04-28 01:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(280424, 19769, 4210, '<td valign="top">Erm.... I don''t like the way the hands are flipped opposite ways, but I think it was intentional, so more power to you. Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'Erm.... I don''t like the way the hands are flipped opposite ways, but I think it was intentional, so more power to you. Otherwise, very nice.', '2003-04-28 01:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(280425, 19737, 806, '<td valign="top">rockem sockem robots! we had these as kids! they were awesome. great vibrant colors. nice presentation.</td>', 'rockem sockem robots! we had these as kids! they were awesome. great vibrant colors. nice presentation.', '2003-04-28 01:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(280426, 19766, 4210, '<td valign="top">I like the colours. Image could be larger, but I suppose you''ll hear alot of that. Don''t worry about it.</td>', 'I like the colours. Image could be larger, but I suppose you''ll hear alot of that. Don''t worry about it.', '2003-04-28 01:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(280427, 19717, 4625, '<td valign="top">I think it would have looked better with the whole thing either in color or sepia... the mix feels odd to me.</td>', 'I think it would have looked better with the whole thing either in color or sepia... the mix feels odd to me.', '2003-04-28 01:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(280429, 19620, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a REALLY nice triptych.  It is well put together and framed nicely.  I like the pattern of the background that the idividual photos are lying on.  My only complaint is the yellow backgound behind the whiskey bottle.  To me, it doesn''t really seem to go well since it''s such an extreme color in comparison to the earthtone hues of the whisky.  It really fights for attention.</td>', 'This is a REALLY nice triptych.  It is well put together and framed nicely.  I like the pattern of the background that the idividual photos are lying on.  My only complaint is the yellow backgound behind the whiskey bottle.  To me, it doesn''t really seem to go well since it''s such an extreme color in comparison to the earthtone hues of the whisky.  It really fights for attention.', '2003-04-28 01:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(280433, 19710, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!!  Very unique and well put together.  I really like the colors.  Appears to be a nicely done front to a greating card.  Congrads on a nice submission.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done!!  Very unique and well put together.  I really like the colors.  Appears to be a nicely done front to a greating card.  Congrads on a nice submission.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-28 02:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(280437, 19331, 6035, '<td valign="top">i love the images, but i cant help be feel like you should have stuck to either B&amp;W or color...</td>', 'i love the images, but i cant help be feel like you should have stuck to either B&W or color...', '2003-04-28 02:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280438, 19764, 6035, '<td valign="top">wow.. all three great shots and very well arranged.. hmm.. yep.. a 10 for you!</td>', 'wow.. all three great shots and very well arranged.. hmm.. yep.. a 10 for you!', '2003-04-28 02:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280443, 19569, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting on this.  It is beautiful.  Awesome, Awesome work and photo''s.  A 10 all the way.</td>', 'I love your lighting on this.  It is beautiful.  Awesome, Awesome work and photo''s.  A 10 all the way.', '2003-04-28 02:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280444, 19584, 6202, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  Great family photo at the same time.</td>', 'Fantastic image.  Great family photo at the same time.', '2003-04-28 02:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
