(280692, 19762, 7536, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I would like to see what the color version looks like. Black &amp; white is nice though.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I would like to see what the color version looks like. Black & white is nice though.', '2003-04-28 11:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(280693, 19360, 4493, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The portraits are crisp and have great tones. You put them together in a pleasing format too.</td>', 'I really like this. The portraits are crisp and have great tones. You put them together in a pleasing format too.', '2003-04-28 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(280694, 19760, 7536, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The lighting is consistent in all three shots and it''s nice and clear.</td>', 'Very nice! The lighting is consistent in all three shots and it''s nice and clear.', '2003-04-28 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280696, 19407, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the colours, in particular the yellow and the two blues at the opposite top corners.  Possibly the composition would have been more effective if the interior margins (the blacks between the three pictures) would have been smaller than the outside edge.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the colours, in particular the yellow and the two blues at the opposite top corners.  Possibly the composition would have been more effective if the interior margins (the blacks between the three pictures) would have been smaller than the outside edge.', '2003-04-28 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280697, 19576, 7536, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like the fade effect between the images. At first glance it looked like a single image.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like the fade effect between the images. At first glance it looked like a single image.', '2003-04-28 11:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(280699, 19415, 5112, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.  The composition might be better if there were no outside white edge (around everything), that is, just a big black border.  The letters need to be much bolder, possibly off-centre?</td>', 'Pretty good.  The composition might be better if there were no outside white edge (around everything), that is, just a big black border.  The letters need to be much bolder, possibly off-centre?', '2003-04-28 11:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280700, 19757, 7536, '<td valign="top">Very interesting views. I especially like that the weather is changing in all three. Most people don''t know that can happen within a very short time in the mountains.</td>', 'Very interesting views. I especially like that the weather is changing in all three. Most people don''t know that can happen within a very short time in the mountains.', '2003-04-28 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(280701, 19616, 4517, '<td valign="top">I`ll give you extra marks for the great camera, but the left photo has a different border.</td>', 'I`ll give you extra marks for the great camera, but the left photo has a different border.', '2003-04-28 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280703, 19674, 5112, '<td valign="top">Like the colours, like the beer (although I prefer Canadian or Rickard\''s Red).  One nitpicky comment, I think a bit or extra space between \"O\" and \"Canada!\" would be better.  Also, the pictures need to be aligned a bit more carefully.</td>', 'Like the colours, like the beer (although I prefer Canadian or Rickard\''s Red).  One nitpicky comment, I think a bit or extra space between \"O\" and \"Canada!\" would be better.  Also, the pictures need to be aligned a bit more carefully.', '2003-04-28 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(280704, 19065, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The buttonizing distracts.  Simple borders might have been better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The buttonizing distracts.  Simple borders might have been better.', '2003-04-28 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(280705, 19596, 4055, '<td valign="top">Good focus in all three. You have put them together very well. I don´t think it´s a good idea to use italian textstyle when you write vertically. But that is just a small detail. I like your picture very much and it´s one of my favourites this week. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Good focus in all three. You have put them together very well. I don´t think it´s a good idea to use italian textstyle when you write vertically. But that is just a small detail. I like your picture very much and it´s one of my favourites this week. Well done and good luck!', '2003-04-28 11:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(280706, 19668, 7536, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The image in the upper right doesn''t quite seem to fit with the others, but it is still relevant to the overall subject.</td>', 'Nice composition. The image in the upper right doesn''t quite seem to fit with the others, but it is still relevant to the overall subject.', '2003-04-28 11:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(280707, 19749, 6855, '<td valign="top">Very cool -  I love the comic book look. Very well done.</td>', 'Very cool -  I love the comic book look. Very well done.', '2003-04-28 11:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(280708, 19736, 2764, '<td valign="top">dark?</td>', 'dark?', '2003-04-28 11:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(280709, 19236, 7536, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Although I think it would look better if they werent so spaced out from top to bottom. It creates too much blank space in the upper right and lower left corners.</td>', 'Very nice. Although I think it would look better if they werent so spaced out from top to bottom. It creates too much blank space in the upper right and lower left corners.', '2003-04-28 11:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(280710, 19280, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colours, nice cat ... the two tone tan inner border is too heavy.</td>', 'Good composition and colours, nice cat ... the two tone tan inner border is too heavy.', '2003-04-28 11:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(280711, 19280, 2764, '<td valign="top">The biggest picture is the weakest of the three - Also if I follow the gaze of the cat, all three lead me out of the picture frame without a strong compostional element to bring my eye back.  Once the viewer''s eye travels out of the picture he thinks "okay, I''m done''.</td>', 'The biggest picture is the weakest of the three - Also if I follow the gaze of the cat, all three lead me out of the picture frame without a strong compostional element to bring my eye back.  Once the viewer''s eye travels out of the picture he thinks "okay, I''m done''.', '2003-04-28 11:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(280712, 19668, 6855, '<td valign="top">I love everything here except the water - looks a little brown and detraicts from the brightness of the lighthouse.  Still great shots!!</td>', 'I love everything here except the water - looks a little brown and detraicts from the brightness of the lighthouse.  Still great shots!!', '2003-04-28 11:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(280713, 19355, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the touch of color in the middle frame. This composition is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'I like the touch of color in the middle frame. This composition is very pleasing to the eye.', '2003-04-28 11:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(280714, 19583, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting and colors. The layout works nicely.</td>', 'Very good lighting and colors. The layout works nicely.', '2003-04-28 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(280715, 19302, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, great colours!  The choice of font is very good, but the underline is not - the font size might have been larger.  I find the alignment distracting, the bigger borders around the pictures at the left vs. at the right.  An idea - use just one red border around all three pictures, line them up more precisely, make the lettering boder (and not underlined).</td>', 'Nice concept, great colours!  The choice of font is very good, but the underline is not - the font size might have been larger.  I find the alignment distracting, the bigger borders around the pictures at the left vs. at the right.  An idea - use just one red border around all three pictures, line them up more precisely, make the lettering boder (and not underlined).', '2003-04-28 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(280716, 19627, 6855, '<td valign="top">Was this meant to have a watercolor effect?   It looks reallly blury, but I can''t tell if it was supposed to be that way.  I think ti''s adorable, and a gret capture of a very sweet little girl!</td>', 'Was this meant to have a watercolor effect?   It looks reallly blury, but I can''t tell if it was supposed to be that way.  I think ti''s adorable, and a gret capture of a very sweet little girl!', '2003-04-28 11:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280717, 19177, 2764, '<td valign="top">I thought porn was banned... very cute,  i don''t like the oval frames, though.</td>', 'I thought porn was banned... very cute,  i don''t like the oval frames, though.', '2003-04-28 11:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(280718, 19616, 5112, '<td valign="top">Sharp pictures, good concept.  The purple is distracting (maybe a heavy all black border instead?).  The pictures are not aligned quite right, and the picture to the left is slightly smaller than the other two.</td>', 'Sharp pictures, good concept.  The purple is distracting (maybe a heavy all black border instead?).  The pictures are not aligned quite right, and the picture to the left is slightly smaller than the other two.', '2003-04-28 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(280719, 19448, 5112, '<td valign="top">Way too many words!  BTW, what happened to the poor guy?</td>', 'Way too many words!  BTW, what happened to the poor guy?', '2003-04-28 11:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(280720, 19587, 6855, '<td valign="top">Please tell me this isn''t real.  This is truly a disturbing image.</td>', 'Please tell me this isn''t real.  This is truly a disturbing image.', '2003-04-28 11:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(280721, 19106, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good concept, nice use of sepia tones.  The picture in the middle is a bit too dark.  The pictures need to be aligned a bit better (space between 1 and 2 is larger then space between 2 and 3, left to right).  I like the bigger side borders.</td>', 'Good concept, nice use of sepia tones.  The picture in the middle is a bit too dark.  The pictures need to be aligned a bit better (space between 1 and 2 is larger then space between 2 and 3, left to right).  I like the bigger side borders.', '2003-04-28 11:24:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(280722, 19250, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very original concept and layout. This is a nice piece of art.</td>', 'Very original concept and layout. This is a nice piece of art.', '2003-04-28 11:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(280723, 19177, 6855, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, what was on your mind that day?? Still clever!</td>', 'Hmmmm, what was on your mind that day?? Still clever!', '2003-04-28 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(280724, 19065, 6855, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Very pleasing to look at, and the 3-D effect is wonderful.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Very pleasing to look at, and the 3-D effect is wonderful.', '2003-04-28 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(280725, 19026, 4493, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting real make this stand out. The overall balance and symmetry works to keep the eye from just gravitating to one spot. Excellent work! 10 -danny</td>', 'The colors and lighting real make this stand out. The overall balance and symmetry works to keep the eye from just gravitating to one spot. Excellent work! 10 -danny', '2003-04-28 11:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(280726, 19569, 6855, '<td valign="top">Looks like a poster through and through. Great job capturing the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a poster through and through. Great job capturing the challenge.', '2003-04-28 11:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280728, 19739, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, well put together.  One nitpicky comment, I think the composition would be better if all three pictures had no horizon line, like the one in the middle.  Also, the middle picture might be centered a bit more.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful colours, well put together.  One nitpicky comment, I think the composition would be better if all three pictures had no horizon line, like the one in the middle.  Also, the middle picture might be centered a bit more.  Good job!', '2003-04-28 11:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(280729, 19668, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The individual pictures are a bit "muddy" though.  As a composition, it would benefit from being arranged in a tighter fashion.</td>', 'Good idea.  The individual pictures are a bit "muddy" though.  As a composition, it would benefit from being arranged in a tighter fashion.', '2003-04-28 11:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(280730, 19652, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfect! Great tones and layout. 10 -danny</td>', 'Perfect! Great tones and layout. 10 -danny', '2003-04-28 11:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(280732, 19550, 4493, '<td valign="top">Any of these 3 shots could stand well on their own, but together they make a great piece of art. I love the mood presented here.</td>', 'Any of these 3 shots could stand well on their own, but together they make a great piece of art. I love the mood presented here.', '2003-04-28 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(280733, 19480, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The lettering needs to be bolder.  How about aligning it with the bottom of the two side pictures, and as wide as the middle picture?  Maybe space out the letters a bit more.  The inner margins (between pictures) would be better smaller than the outer margins.</td>', 'Good idea.  The lettering needs to be bolder.  How about aligning it with the bottom of the two side pictures, and as wide as the middle picture?  Maybe space out the letters a bit more.  The inner margins (between pictures) would be better smaller than the outer margins.', '2003-04-28 11:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(280735, 19764, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pictures, good idea.  I think the composition would be stronger if there were one bold margin (maybe all black?).</td>', 'Beautiful pictures, good idea.  I think the composition would be stronger if there were one bold margin (maybe all black?).', '2003-04-28 11:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(280736, 19620, 4967, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the challenge.  Thi is very well done.... good photography, nice work putting it together!  Love the background that is still the bottle, good balance and color work... overall a very well done triptych.  -10-</td>', 'My favorite for the challenge.  Thi is very well done.... good photography, nice work putting it together!  Love the background that is still the bottle, good balance and color work... overall a very well done triptych.  -10-', '2003-04-28 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(280737, 19605, 4967, '<td valign="top">This should do pretty well.  Good photography and put together beautifully, if you had better berries this would be an awesome strawberry add!  I love the colors you used... overall very well done.  One of five -10-''s for the challenge!</td>', 'This should do pretty well.  Good photography and put together beautifully, if you had better berries this would be an awesome strawberry add!  I love the colors you used... overall very well done.  One of five -10-''s for the challenge!', '2003-04-28 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(280738, 19731, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good use of B/W. Possibly a stronger outside border?  There seems to be a slight white line at the bottom of the third (bottom right) picture - it''s distracting.  Also, I''m left wondering what''s at the bottom left - possibly the bottom picture could be cropped to fit the whole of the bottom section?</td>', 'Good composition, good use of B/W. Possibly a stronger outside border?  There seems to be a slight white line at the bottom of the third (bottom right) picture - it''s distracting.  Also, I''m left wondering what''s at the bottom left - possibly the bottom picture could be cropped to fit the whole of the bottom section?', '2003-04-28 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(280742, 19553, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, beautiful colours!  The heavy red margins distract.  Suggestion: make the pictures the same size, write "Tulips in the Sun" across the bottom (in a light colour, not in red), use a slight red margin either around the two pictures or around the whole composition.</td>', 'Good idea, beautiful colours!  The heavy red margins distract.  Suggestion: make the pictures the same size, write "Tulips in the Sun" across the bottom (in a light colour, not in red), use a slight red margin either around the two pictures or around the whole composition.', '2003-04-28 11:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280744, 19728, 5112, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of doing this, went with something else.  Good job!  I like the stripes behind the kid.  Love the smile in the middle pict.  I like the composition. Overall, I think it might be more powerful if the little one were not so happy - oh well.</td>', 'I was thinking of doing this, went with something else.  Good job!  I like the stripes behind the kid.  Love the smile in the middle pict.  I like the composition. Overall, I think it might be more powerful if the little one were not so happy - oh well.', '2003-04-28 11:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(280745, 19760, 4493, '<td valign="top">I love the mood in this. You have brought the spiritual feel to this. The clouds and tones work nicely together. Good work!</td>', 'I love the mood in this. You have brought the spiritual feel to this. The clouds and tones work nicely together. Good work!', '2003-04-28 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(280748, 19710, 7536, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the original idea and the choice of black &amp; white with limited color.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the original idea and the choice of black & white with limited color.', '2003-04-28 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(280751, 19747, 7536, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. It would be interesting to see the full-sized version. The size rules for the challenge make it difficult to get the detail of the photos.</td>', 'Nicely done. It would be interesting to see the full-sized version. The size rules for the challenge make it difficult to get the detail of the photos.', '2003-04-28 11:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280753, 19579, 7536, '<td valign="top">Great original idea! Very well done!</td>', 'Great original idea! Very well done!', '2003-04-28 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280755, 19672, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this image quite a bit.  I''m one who enjoys shapes and patterns and this image works well for me because of that.  There are only two minor issues that I think could use some improvement in this composition.... 1 - the text at the top could stand to be just a tad brigher and 2 - the spacing between the two images should probably match the spacing on the outer edges of the frame so it doesn''t look like they are just stuffed together.  Presentation is everything in a composition like this :)  Excellent shot, great idea and the black and white makes this one very strong.... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'I really like this image quite a bit.  I''m one who enjoys shapes and patterns and this image works well for me because of that.  There are only two minor issues that I think could use some improvement in this composition.... 1 - the text at the top could stand to be just a tad brigher and 2 - the spacing between the two images should probably match the spacing on the outer edges of the frame so it doesn''t look like they are just stuffed together.  Presentation is everything in a composition like this :)  Excellent shot, great idea and the black and white makes this one very strong.... great work :) - setzler', '2003-04-28 11:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280756, 19727, 7536, '<td valign="top">Great example of sports photography. Clear and well-defined images. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Great example of sports photography. Clear and well-defined images. Very nicely done.', '2003-04-28 11:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280758, 19690, 7536, '<td valign="top">Overall this is a good composition. I think the effects might be a little overdone, but it''s a interesting picture.</td>', 'Overall this is a good composition. I think the effects might be a little overdone, but it''s a interesting picture.', '2003-04-28 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(280759, 19278, 7536, '<td valign="top">This is a great take on the classic car posters. Very original idea!</td>', 'This is a great take on the classic car posters. Very original idea!', '2003-04-28 11:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280761, 19221, 7536, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea. Very well composed with nice, clear images.</td>', 'This is a great idea. Very well composed with nice, clear images.', '2003-04-28 11:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(280762, 19280, 2011, '<td valign="top">Im not a big fan of cats, or cat pictures, but this is nice.  The sepia tone works extremely well, and the cat is actually doing something!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Im not a big fan of cats, or cat pictures, but this is nice.  The sepia tone works extremely well, and the cat is actually doing something!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-28 11:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(280763, 19221, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition, lighting and tones. 10 -danny</td>', 'Perfect composition, lighting and tones. 10 -danny', '2003-04-28 11:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(280764, 19628, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Good job!</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Good job!', '2003-04-28 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(280765, 19739, 327, '<td valign="top">Very inventive, creative shooting. The colors are great. I see a few things I''d change, but they are very minor. Good job.</td>', 'Very inventive, creative shooting. The colors are great. I see a few things I''d change, but they are very minor. Good job.', '2003-04-28 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(280767, 19583, 7536, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. It looks like a magazine add.</td>', 'Nice composition. It looks like a magazine add.', '2003-04-28 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280768, 19725, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good color and exposure. Nicely composed, good framing.</td>', 'Nice!  Good color and exposure. Nicely composed, good framing.', '2003-04-28 11:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(280770, 19749, 7536, '<td valign="top">The black &amp; white images are nice, but there is too much empty space in the bottom half of the picture. Nice idea though.</td>', 'The black & white images are nice, but there is too much empty space in the bottom half of the picture. Nice idea though.', '2003-04-28 11:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280771, 19685, 1280, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and coloring.  Unique idea.  Good job!</td>', 'nice lighting and coloring.  Unique idea.  Good job!', '2003-04-28 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(280772, 19221, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful work... this is probably one of my favorites in this challenge.  Each of the three images has strong photographic merit on its own and the composition represents a theme/story that doesn''t require any explanation to me :)  This is a great black and white series... excellent work... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful work... this is probably one of my favorites in this challenge.  Each of the three images has strong photographic merit on its own and the composition represents a theme/story that doesn''t require any explanation to me :)  This is a great black and white series... excellent work... = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-28 11:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(280773, 19407, 2011, '<td valign="top">VERY nice, and what a talented child.  You must be very proud.  I find the carpet in the first frame a little distracting, but thats the only thing maybe I would change.  Good job. 8</td>', 'VERY nice, and what a talented child.  You must be very proud.  I find the carpet in the first frame a little distracting, but thats the only thing maybe I would change.  Good job. 8', '2003-04-28 11:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(280774, 19731, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great play with the shadows. I like your overall feel and tone to this shot.</td>', 'Great play with the shadows. I like your overall feel and tone to this shot.', '2003-04-28 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(280776, 19659, 2011, '<td valign="top">Wish this one wasnt cropped so close across the top.</td>', 'Wish this one wasnt cropped so close across the top.', '2003-04-28 11:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(280779, 19750, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely spot....The colors are really nice, rich, deep. The light is very nice. Good composition, clean shots.</td>', 'Lovely spot....The colors are really nice, rich, deep. The light is very nice. Good composition, clean shots.', '2003-04-28 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(280780, 19752, 4536, '<td valign="top">I love peacock photos and this one is funny too! It would have been good if you flipped the shots so they were leading into the center instead of out the sides, so that my eyes aren''t led out of the frame so easily.</td>', 'I love peacock photos and this one is funny too! It would have been good if you flipped the shots so they were leading into the center instead of out the sides, so that my eyes aren''t led out of the frame so easily.', '2003-04-28 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(280782, 19501, 327, '<td valign="top">Hair....look at that hair. :) Darling shots but a bit dark and the focus is a little soft. You have a good model to shoot for the next 90 years.</td>', 'Hair....look at that hair. :) Darling shots but a bit dark and the focus is a little soft. You have a good model to shoot for the next 90 years.', '2003-04-28 12:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(280783, 19710, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2003-04-28 12:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(280784, 19742, 327, '<td valign="top">This was a cool idea, creative. Nice color, compositon. The grass is a little dark, but it''s okay.</td>', 'This was a cool idea, creative. Nice color, compositon. The grass is a little dark, but it''s okay.', '2003-04-28 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(280785, 19584, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-04-28 12:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(280787, 19587, 4536, '<td valign="top">Fascinating. I have a hankering to see a body or a body part though.</td>', 'Fascinating. I have a hankering to see a body or a body part though.', '2003-04-28 12:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280788, 19695, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool shot.</td>', 'Kool shot.', '2003-04-28 12:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(280789, 19587, 2011, '<td valign="top">Im not sure that Im getting what your trying to tell me in this pic.  I THINK I know..........Would have hated to have to clean up the mess.  OK story part is good, but I think you may get voted down because of the middle shot.  This is the longest Ive ever look at and studied a DPC photo.  Must mean its good.: )</td>', 'Im not sure that Im getting what your trying to tell me in this pic.  I THINK I know..........Would have hated to have to clean up the mess.  OK story part is good, but I think you may get voted down because of the middle shot.  This is the longest Ive ever look at and studied a DPC photo.  Must mean its good.: )', '2003-04-28 12:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(280791, 19755, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, good looking gull. A bit oof and the color is a little bit flat. Still a nice lookin'' bird.</td>', 'Yes, good looking gull. A bit oof and the color is a little bit flat. Still a nice lookin'' bird.', '2003-04-28 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(280792, 19764, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very warm and inviting. I like the mood and tones. Your colors and exposures are perfect. Good job.</td>', 'Very warm and inviting. I like the mood and tones. Your colors and exposures are perfect. Good job.', '2003-04-28 12:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
