(280795, 19716, 4536, '<td valign="top">I love the large shot on the top right! The close up of the steps look fuzzy and takes away from the rest of the shot. well composed and nice lettering/font.</td>', 'I love the large shot on the top right! The close up of the steps look fuzzy and takes away from the rest of the shot. well composed and nice lettering/font.', '2003-04-28 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
