(280831, 19751, 7536, '<td valign="top">Nice individual photos, but the arrangement is odd. Other than the palm leaves, you don''t get a really clear view of any details. The lower left image should be smaller or pulled to the left a little bit.</td>', 'Nice individual photos, but the arrangement is odd. Other than the palm leaves, you don''t get a really clear view of any details. The lower left image should be smaller or pulled to the left a little bit.', '2003-04-28 12:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(280832, 19712, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of soft focus (or filter?) - it makes the image seem to glow. My only criticism would be in the assembly of the triptych - I feel the line of the angled roof ought to flow straight from one frame to the other - in your assembly the line is slightly out. Nice image(s) though with a beautiful old time feel.</td>', 'Interesting use of soft focus (or filter?) - it makes the image seem to glow. My only criticism would be in the assembly of the triptych - I feel the line of the angled roof ought to flow straight from one frame to the other - in your assembly the line is slightly out. Nice image(s) though with a beautiful old time feel.', '2003-04-28 12:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(280835, 19278, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well chosen font and border decisions - looks like something I can imagine on sale on a postcard in a motor enthusiasts shop or at a rally or such. Nice colours, lighting a little harsh.</td>', 'Well chosen font and border decisions - looks like something I can imagine on sale on a postcard in a motor enthusiasts shop or at a rally or such. Nice colours, lighting a little harsh.', '2003-04-28 12:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
