(280848, 19641, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good colour and light. Choice of background colour just right. I would rather have the left and right images the same height as the central one. The white space behind just makes an odd and unappealing shape for me.</td>', 'Great idea and good colour and light. Choice of background colour just right. I would rather have the left and right images the same height as the central one. The white space behind just makes an odd and unappealing shape for me.', '2003-04-28 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
