(280855, 19280, 4517, '<td valign="top">3 great shots and i like the sepia but its a shame about the messy bit top center that looks like you have tried to correct. Apart from that it`s very good.</td>', '3 great shots and i like the sepia but its a shame about the messy bit top center that looks like you have tried to correct. Apart from that it`s very good.', '2003-04-28 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(280856, 19619, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the images here and the different scales represented but am really not at all keen on the way the lower tulip is on it''s side. That feels wrong to me.</td>', 'I like the images here and the different scales represented but am really not at all keen on the way the lower tulip is on it''s side. That feels wrong to me.', '2003-04-28 12:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(280857, 19662, 3087, '<td valign="top">I know I sound like a parrot - and am wary after the recent comments in forum about repetitive comments - but I''m not at all keen on the different heights of images used here. Also, to me this is one photo cut into three - nothing wrong with that at all - it''s like looking through a bay window - but I''m personally keener on entries where there are three seperate images used - images that support each other but are different. Just my two pence though!</td>', 'I know I sound like a parrot - and am wary after the recent comments in forum about repetitive comments - but I''m not at all keen on the different heights of images used here. Also, to me this is one photo cut into three - nothing wrong with that at all - it''s like looking through a bay window - but I''m personally keener on entries where there are three seperate images used - images that support each other but are different. Just my two pence though!', '2003-04-28 12:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(280858, 19694, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Took me a moments to warm up to it though...</td>', 'Interesting idea. Took me a moments to warm up to it though...', '2003-04-28 12:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(280859, 19636, 4210, '<td valign="top">Could have used more space between the photos. But very nice detail.</td>', 'Could have used more space between the photos. But very nice detail.', '2003-04-28 12:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(280860, 19236, 4210, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space I''m afraid....</td>', 'Too much negative space I''m afraid....', '2003-04-28 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(280861, 19177, 4517, '<td valign="top">You have done well with quite a dull subject, but some nice new shiny bolts may have looked better and the right hand pic could have been made smaller to fit the egg shape border.</td>', 'You have done well with quite a dull subject, but some nice new shiny bolts may have looked better and the right hand pic could have been made smaller to fit the egg shape border.', '2003-04-28 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(280862, 19106, 4210, '<td valign="top">Simple. Nice. Elegant.</td>', 'Simple. Nice. Elegant.', '2003-04-28 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(280864, 19678, 4210, '<td valign="top">The photos seem very busy without a real center to focus on.</td>', 'The photos seem very busy without a real center to focus on.', '2003-04-28 12:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(280866, 19579, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done indeed. I''ve enjoyed really looking at this one in depth and think the way you''ve suggested that the image on the right is actually looking at the central image is very clever. The negative strip background definitely adds interest for me too. I think this is a winner and very commercial - I can see it on a promo postcard advertising underwear. If it''s an original idea have you thought about sending it to some companies to suggest the idea for a future campaign?</td>', 'This is very nicely done indeed. I''ve enjoyed really looking at this one in depth and think the way you''ve suggested that the image on the right is actually looking at the central image is very clever. The negative strip background definitely adds interest for me too. I think this is a winner and very commercial - I can see it on a promo postcard advertising underwear. If it''s an original idea have you thought about sending it to some companies to suggest the idea for a future campaign?', '2003-04-28 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280867, 19278, 4210, '<td valign="top">I would have used green instead of blue.</td>', 'I would have used green instead of blue.', '2003-04-28 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280868, 19091, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very Nice. I love the grayscale. The lines are very attractive.</td>', 'Very Nice. I love the grayscale. The lines are very attractive.', '2003-04-28 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(280869, 19620, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t drink, but you really make whiskey look attractive with your soft focus and warm colors. 9</td>', 'I don''t drink, but you really make whiskey look attractive with your soft focus and warm colors. 9', '2003-04-28 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(280870, 19659, 4517, '<td valign="top">Now that is very different, not seen a pic like this before.</td>', 'Now that is very different, not seen a pic like this before.', '2003-04-28 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(280871, 19674, 4210, '<td valign="top">I would have tried different angles on the bottles to make it more visually interesting, but still, you get a laugh out of me.</td>', 'I would have tried different angles on the bottles to make it more visually interesting, but still, you get a laugh out of me.', '2003-04-28 12:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(280872, 19739, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting but I think it would be stronger with three more different poses, all in silhouette. Perhaps from left to right, with arms low, half way up and all the way raised? Or, if the model could manage it, the same pose with different sunset colours behind. I also think it might be stronger with black separators between the three images.</td>', 'This is really interesting but I think it would be stronger with three more different poses, all in silhouette. Perhaps from left to right, with arms low, half way up and all the way raised? Or, if the model could manage it, the same pose with different sunset colours behind. I also think it might be stronger with black separators between the three images.', '2003-04-28 12:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(280873, 19678, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your middle photo is the best, I feel, with its nice tones and colors and focus. Point of view is excellent,too. The top one looks so similar, I would appreciate a more diverse view of this journey.</td>', 'Your middle photo is the best, I feel, with its nice tones and colors and focus. Point of view is excellent,too. The top one looks so similar, I would appreciate a more diverse view of this journey.', '2003-04-28 12:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(280875, 19616, 4210, '<td valign="top">Cute and creative. The photos could be a little bit higher quality though. They seem kinda fuzzy.</td>', 'Cute and creative. The photos could be a little bit higher quality though. They seem kinda fuzzy.', '2003-04-28 12:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(280876, 19672, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hi Da!<br/>Can''t read the text - it''s just too dark on my monitor - well, I can if I get REALLY close to the screen but that''s not too practical. I like the two images but the layout doesn''t work for me - it doesn''t feel balanced or deliberately composed.</td>', 'Hi Da!Can''t read the text - it''s just too dark on my monitor - well, I can if I get REALLY close to the screen but that''s not too practical. I like the two images but the layout doesn''t work for me - it doesn''t feel balanced or deliberately composed.', '2003-04-28 12:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(280877, 19768, 4210, '<td valign="top">Not exactly in the spirit of the challenge I think.</td>', 'Not exactly in the spirit of the challenge I think.', '2003-04-28 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
