(280901, 19737, 2667, '<td valign="top">I wish the text had read ROCKem SOCKem instead of epic battle. Still, I like it a lot.</td>', 'I wish the text had read ROCKem SOCKem instead of epic battle. Still, I like it a lot.', '2003-04-28 12:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
