(280904, 19710, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice, fun, good colours and black and white, great expression and simple treatment of borders and background! I like it!</td>', 'Nice, fun, good colours and black and white, great expression and simple treatment of borders and background! I like it!', '2003-04-28 12:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(280907, 19690, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think I''d really like this with the straight images, without the painting filters applied to them. Like the layout of the three images very much.</td>', 'I think I''d really like this with the straight images, without the painting filters applied to them. Like the layout of the three images very much.', '2003-04-28 13:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280908, 19681, 675, '<td valign="top">this is a really creative idea, however for me the lens flares kill most of the effect</td>', 'this is a really creative idea, however for me the lens flares kill most of the effect', '2003-04-28 13:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(280909, 19764, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strong collection of images - very much postcard material. (That''s not meant to be an insult).</td>', 'Strong collection of images - very much postcard material. (That''s not meant to be an insult).', '2003-04-28 13:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(280910, 19429, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image, strong composition and subtle composite - I think this one is excellent!</td>', 'Nice image, strong composition and subtle composite - I think this one is excellent!', '2003-04-28 13:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(280911, 19628, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice images - good colour and I like the tight crops. Some of the reflections are a little distracting. Well put together also.</td>', 'Nice images - good colour and I like the tight crops. Some of the reflections are a little distracting. Well put together also.', '2003-04-28 13:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(280912, 19583, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever - I like the change in scale from left to right. I think this is quite professional in appearance.</td>', 'Clever - I like the change in scale from left to right. I think this is quite professional in appearance.', '2003-04-28 13:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(280913, 19716, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great images! I really like the forms and lines you''ve captured. I think this composite needs thicker black borders between the images.</td>', 'Great images! I really like the forms and lines you''ve captured. I think this composite needs thicker black borders between the images.', '2003-04-28 13:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(280914, 19766, 675, '<td valign="top">tighter crops on each image would have been better<br/></td>', 'tighter crops on each image would have been better', '2003-04-28 13:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280915, 19091, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple idea. My preference would be for the images to be the same height and for the background to be plain.</td>', 'Nice and simple idea. My preference would be for the images to be the same height and for the background to be plain.', '2003-04-28 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(280916, 19579, 4517, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge and not just because she`s showing her knickers. Well, ok that`s the main reason but also its a great set up that works very well and the film effect is excellent. If you have any out-takes feel free to send me them ;-)  10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge and not just because she`s showing her knickers. Well, ok that`s the main reason but also its a great set up that works very well and the film effect is excellent. If you have any out-takes feel free to send me them ;-)  10', '2003-04-28 13:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(280917, 19091, 675, '<td valign="top">the lines are a bit too disjointed</td>', 'the lines are a bit too disjointed', '2003-04-28 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(280918, 19616, 675, '<td valign="top">ahhh, isn''t it great to be in the last five pages of a challenge?</td>', 'ahhh, isn''t it great to be in the last five pages of a challenge?', '2003-04-28 13:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280919, 19514, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this - especially the first of the three images. A great story within a triptych/ tryptich (I can''t remember and now neither looks right!).</td>', 'I really like this - especially the first of the three images. A great story within a triptych/ tryptich (I can''t remember and now neither looks right!).', '2003-04-28 13:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(280920, 19234, 675, '<td valign="top">this photo is disturbing.  the middle picture is totally out of place</td>', 'this photo is disturbing.  the middle picture is totally out of place', '2003-04-28 13:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(280921, 19026, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is really well done - nice simple but striking images and a strong layout. Text and borders that complement rather than detract.</td>', 'This is really well done - nice simple but striking images and a strong layout. Text and borders that complement rather than detract.', '2003-04-28 13:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(280924, 19059, 4517, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and just look at her face 10</td>', 'Excellent lighting and just look at her face 10', '2003-04-28 13:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(280925, 19710, 4517, '<td valign="top">Excellent top 5 for you. 9</td>', 'Excellent top 5 for you. 9', '2003-04-28 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(280927, 19652, 5391, '<td valign="top">Extremely cool image.  Creative idea, technically well done b/w work, good lighting, and I like the ''traditional'' tryptich layout.  10</td>', 'Extremely cool image.  Creative idea, technically well done b/w work, good lighting, and I like the ''traditional'' tryptich layout.  10', '2003-04-28 13:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(280928, 19739, 4517, '<td valign="top">very nice colours, simple but vert effective 9</td>', 'very nice colours, simple but vert effective 9', '2003-04-28 13:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(280931, 19678, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like the top 2 photos and the film effect border but i`m not to keen on the bottom photo. Still an 8</td>', 'I like the top 2 photos and the film effect border but i`m not to keen on the bottom photo. Still an 8', '2003-04-28 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(280935, 19716, 6870, '<td valign="top">Curves are especially nice! Steps are a bit grainy and  out of focus. Nice "through line" and composition.</td>', 'Curves are especially nice! Steps are a bit grainy and  out of focus. Nice "through line" and composition.', '2003-04-28 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(280937, 19331, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the progressively closer take, with the color one being last. That''s good storytelling!</td>', 'I like the progressively closer take, with the color one being last. That''s good storytelling!', '2003-04-28 13:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(280938, 19069, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this one in a larger format to see all of those intricate designs. wonderful lighting and tones here.</td>', 'I''d like to see this one in a larger format to see all of those intricate designs. wonderful lighting and tones here.', '2003-04-28 13:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(280940, 19605, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good stock photography.</td>', 'Good stock photography.', '2003-04-28 13:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280941, 19587, 6870, '<td valign="top">I guess there''s always time for a  horror movie.... A bit scary, but well "executed."</td>', 'I guess there''s always time for a  horror movie.... A bit scary, but well "executed."', '2003-04-28 13:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(280942, 19234, 4210, '<td valign="top">A little too much lightness. And perhaps 3 different photos would have been more interesting.</td>', 'A little too much lightness. And perhaps 3 different photos would have been more interesting.', '2003-04-28 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(280943, 19302, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice individual images, though two are a little overwhelmed by the wonderful yellow one. I find the borders a little confusing. There are three images but the red border seems to combine two of them. That doesn''t work for me,<br/>I think the two images on the right are the strongest, individually.</td>', 'Nice individual images, though two are a little overwhelmed by the wonderful yellow one. I find the borders a little confusing. There are three images but the red border seems to combine two of them. That doesn''t work for me,I think the two images on the right are the strongest, individually.', '2003-04-28 13:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(280944, 19736, 6870, '<td valign="top">The three butterflies do indeed give us three different perspectives here.</td>', 'The three butterflies do indeed give us three different perspectives here.', '2003-04-28 13:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(280945, 19757, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Yay for patience and a careful set up!</td>', 'Very nice. Yay for patience and a careful set up!', '2003-04-28 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280946, 19766, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good storytelling progression here. Nice tones and lighting, too. Composition is wonderful. 9</td>', 'Good storytelling progression here. Nice tones and lighting, too. Composition is wonderful. 9', '2003-04-28 13:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(280947, 19561, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Perhaps 3 different images would have been more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting. Perhaps 3 different images would have been more interesting.', '2003-04-28 13:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(280948, 19546, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the atmosphere of this - kind of sad and full of longing. It also makes me think of someone sitting inside in the dark looking out of each of these windows. I am not sure about the gradiated separator lines.</td>', 'I like the atmosphere of this - kind of sad and full of longing. It also makes me think of someone sitting inside in the dark looking out of each of these windows. I am not sure about the gradiated separator lines.', '2003-04-28 13:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280949, 19734, 1379, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition.  I think the dark quality to this really enhances the mood.</td>', 'Lovely composition.  I think the dark quality to this really enhances the mood.', '2003-04-28 13:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280950, 19203, 4210, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I would play with the boarders some more to try to define the photo edges more</td>', 'Pretty. I would play with the boarders some more to try to define the photo edges more', '2003-04-28 13:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280951, 19596, 6870, '<td valign="top">My first 10! This evokes feelings in me that are peaceful and relaxing.  Your round shapes are well used! Even the roundness o fthe twigs help. Aaaaahhhh!</td>', 'My first 10! This evokes feelings in me that are peaceful and relaxing.  Your round shapes are well used! Even the roundness o fthe twigs help. Aaaaahhhh!', '2003-04-28 13:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(280953, 19765, 1379, '<td valign="top">This would make a nice postcard!  That flower on the right is especially delicate and interesting.</td>', 'This would make a nice postcard!  That flower on the right is especially delicate and interesting.', '2003-04-28 13:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(280954, 19576, 4210, '<td valign="top">Not sure exactly what to think of this. It''s an interesting effect.</td>', 'Not sure exactly what to think of this. It''s an interesting effect.', '2003-04-28 13:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(280955, 19415, 6870, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go out on a boat, that''s for sure. Wonderful tones and lighting here. I kind of wish the 1st and 3rd panels provided more diverse points of view on this subject.</td>', 'Makes me want to go out on a boat, that''s for sure. Wonderful tones and lighting here. I kind of wish the 1st and 3rd panels provided more diverse points of view on this subject.', '2003-04-28 13:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(280956, 19264, 1379, '<td valign="top">It''slike a postcard for that place!  I hope you had fun.</td>', 'It''slike a postcard for that place!  I hope you had fun.', '2003-04-28 13:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(280957, 19677, 4210, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great capture!</td>', 'Wow! Great capture!', '2003-04-28 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(280958, 19652, 772, '<td valign="top">I love this set.... i think the subdued lighting and the expressionless children seem to set an intriguing mood in this image.  The composition here really rocks :)  I think you should definitely print and frame this shot... these boys will treasure this when they are older.... kudos :) - 10 - setzler</td>', 'I love this set.... i think the subdued lighting and the expressionless children seem to set an intriguing mood in this image.  The composition here really rocks :)  I think you should definitely print and frame this shot... these boys will treasure this when they are older.... kudos :) - 10 - setzler', '2003-04-28 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280959, 19739, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love that glowing sky.</td>', 'Love that glowing sky.', '2003-04-28 13:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(280960, 19091, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good use of line for focus here.</td>', 'Good use of line for focus here.', '2003-04-28 13:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(280961, 19641, 4210, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I like the pink, but I''m not sure about the gray spaces at the top</td>', 'Pretty. I like the pink, but I''m not sure about the gray spaces at the top', '2003-04-28 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(280962, 19708, 1379, '<td valign="top">How sweet!  I especially like the middle image.  The look on her face is just lovely.</td>', 'How sweet!  I especially like the middle image.  The look on her face is just lovely.', '2003-04-28 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(280963, 19759, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good use of this triptych form. Eyes are all different, and the larger image is right at me. Aagh!</td>', 'Good use of this triptych form. Eyes are all different, and the larger image is right at me. Aagh!', '2003-04-28 13:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(280964, 19681, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I''m not sure that this is in the spirit of the challenge. A very creative idea though!</td>', 'Interesting, but I''m not sure that this is in the spirit of the challenge. A very creative idea though!', '2003-04-28 13:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(280965, 19761, 4210, '<td valign="top">Definately something you might see hanging on a wall somewhere.</td>', 'Definately something you might see hanging on a wall somewhere.', '2003-04-28 13:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280966, 19747, 1379, '<td valign="top">Or maybe your bear is saying "Dang, it''s hot, and I wish I were back home..."<br/>You captured a glorious animal.  I hope s/he got comfortable.</td>', 'Or maybe your bear is saying "Dang, it''s hot, and I wish I were back home..."You captured a glorious animal.  I hope s/he got comfortable.', '2003-04-28 13:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280968, 19620, 675, '<td valign="top">don''t know why you chose a yellow background...black would have kicked major ass</td>', 'don''t know why you chose a yellow background...black would have kicked major ass', '2003-04-28 13:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(280970, 19681, 1379, '<td valign="top">Clever!  It''s like an x-ray!  What a great idea!  (And your car is so clean and shiny, too!)</td>', 'Clever!  It''s like an x-ray!  What a great idea!  (And your car is so clean and shiny, too!)', '2003-04-28 13:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(280971, 19739, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very  nice silhouette. I''m not sure that you need three images that are so similar, though. It does give a feeling of success!</td>', 'Very  nice silhouette. I''m not sure that you need three images that are so similar, though. It does give a feeling of success!', '2003-04-28 13:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280974, 19059, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tender and warm portraits. With the title, I wish I had more clues of the fish.</td>', 'Tender and warm portraits. With the title, I wish I had more clues of the fish.', '2003-04-28 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280975, 19234, 1379, '<td valign="top">It''s a little disconcerting to me.... It keeps making me think of a cyclops creature.  <br/>The large pupil is nice, though, and a difficult effect to attain when using flash.</td>', 'It''s a little disconcerting to me.... It keeps making me think of a cyclops creature.  The large pupil is nice, though, and a difficult effect to attain when using flash.', '2003-04-28 13:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280976, 19415, 1779, '<td valign="top">love the high contrast</td>', 'love the high contrast', '2003-04-28 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(280977, 19493, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the use of PS filters here (photocopy? + ?)</td>', 'I like the use of PS filters here (photocopy? + ?)', '2003-04-28 13:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(280978, 19765, 6870, '<td valign="top">Direct and lovely. This is nicely done.</td>', 'Direct and lovely. This is nicely done.', '2003-04-28 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(280979, 19688, 7920, '<td valign="top">Spectacular work. You must be an artistic genius!  10</td>', 'Spectacular work. You must be an artistic genius!  10', '2003-04-28 13:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(280980, 19276, 6870, '<td valign="top">This looks so cute! I wish these images were in focus.</td>', 'This looks so cute! I wish these images were in focus.', '2003-04-28 13:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280981, 19561, 1379, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  I wonder, though, why you choose to put the center can behind the other two?</td>', 'Interesting composition.  I wonder, though, why you choose to put the center can behind the other two?', '2003-04-28 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(280982, 19397, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaging and puzzling at the same time. Interesting abstract.</td>', 'Engaging and puzzling at the same time. Interesting abstract.', '2003-04-28 13:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280985, 19694, 6870, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! I like the tones and colors of these images, but I wish your 2nd and 3rd panels weren''t so similar.</td>', 'Congratulations! I like the tones and colors of these images, but I wish your 2nd and 3rd panels weren''t so similar.', '2003-04-28 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
