(281195, 19755, 6870, '<td valign="top">This bird''s personality is evident. I''m not sure that it needs three pictures to inform us, though. In other words, these views are so similar that they don''t provide much depth into this animal. Stil, I like the composition and the use of no borders. It gives a more postmodern look to things.</td>', 'This bird''s personality is evident. I''m not sure that it needs three pictures to inform us, though. In other words, these views are so similar that they don''t provide much depth into this animal. Stil, I like the composition and the use of no borders. It gives a more postmodern look to things.', '2003-04-28 16:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
