(281211, 19069, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea!  I like the colours, the layout, and the way the fans point from one side to the other.  I think the composition would be more effective if the middle fan were stronger, consistent with the colour strength of the other two.</td>', 'Beautiful idea!  I like the colours, the layout, and the way the fans point from one side to the other.  I think the composition would be more effective if the middle fan were stronger, consistent with the colour strength of the other two.', '2003-04-28 16:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
