(281410, 19719, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  I wonder how this would look if you make it all one solid house but split into 3 sections.  Don''t know if that makes much sense, but I tried.  The colors are really neat.  To answer the question, I like the blue.  the angle and framing/cropping on the house is good, but the diagonal of the road and cars bothers me.  Can''t really be avoided much, but it just doesn''t seem to "go with the flow". Otherwise, great job. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is really cool.  I wonder how this would look if you make it all one solid house but split into 3 sections.  Don''t know if that makes much sense, but I tried.  The colors are really neat.  To answer the question, I like the blue.  the angle and framing/cropping on the house is good, but the diagonal of the road and cars bothers me.  Can''t really be avoided much, but it just doesn''t seem to "go with the flow". Otherwise, great job. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-28 21:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
