(281419, 19725, 3080, '<td valign="top">The writing on the bottom is quite too small to read well, so I think I''m missing the "story" in this.  The house is interesting, but the left photo is covered by the tree and shadow of the tree and most of it is hard to see much of.  It looks like these photos were taken at different times of the year.  The photo on the right is much more green that on the left.  There are also many more tree buds on the right.  I am curious to know exactly what was on your mind when creating this series.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The writing on the bottom is quite too small to read well, so I think I''m missing the "story" in this.  The house is interesting, but the left photo is covered by the tree and shadow of the tree and most of it is hard to see much of.  It looks like these photos were taken at different times of the year.  The photo on the right is much more green that on the left.  There are also many more tree buds on the right.  I am curious to know exactly what was on your mind when creating this series.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-28 21:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(281421, 19541, 3080, '<td valign="top">To be perfectly honest, this doesn''t appeal much to me.  I understood the challenge to combine 2 or more images to create a story.  This doesn''t really tell a story.  it''s all the same image, and I don''t care for the effect used.  They barely look like owls anymore.  Hope you don''t take offense, it''s just not my cup of tea. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'To be perfectly honest, this doesn''t appeal much to me.  I understood the challenge to combine 2 or more images to create a story.  This doesn''t really tell a story.  it''s all the same image, and I don''t care for the effect used.  They barely look like owls anymore.  Hope you don''t take offense, it''s just not my cup of tea. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-28 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
