(281554, 19569, 2389, '<td valign="top">I like the way the leaves go outside the frame. Good colors and shadows...</td>', 'I like the way the leaves go outside the frame. Good colors and shadows...', '2003-04-29 00:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(281555, 19627, 2389, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect - it is like the pictures almost blend into each other. Well done!</td>', 'Interesting effect - it is like the pictures almost blend into each other. Well done!', '2003-04-29 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(281559, 19250, 2389, '<td valign="top">WOW - I really like this picture, but something about the placement of the small photos on the large one makes them look un-even. Anyway, good colors...</td>', 'WOW - I really like this picture, but something about the placement of the small photos on the large one makes them look un-even. Anyway, good colors...', '2003-04-29 00:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(281561, 19688, 4494, '<td valign="top">OMG, I have NO idea how you did this but it''s really cool!  You can see a little of the border in the middle pic between the black and the bottle, but it''s still great.</td>', 'OMG, I have NO idea how you did this but it''s really cool!  You can see a little of the border in the middle pic between the black and the bottle, but it''s still great.', '2003-04-29 00:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(281562, 19221, 2389, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I especially like the bottom sequence. Makes me feel like it is moving. :)</td>', 'Very well done. I especially like the bottom sequence. Makes me feel like it is moving. :)', '2003-04-29 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(281563, 19579, 4494, '<td valign="top">That is so cool... I can''t believe how creative some of you are!  I love the effect of the film.  I''m glad I didn''t enter this one because I can already tell I''d have NO chance.  Great job!</td>', 'That is so cool... I can''t believe how creative some of you are!  I love the effect of the film.  I''m glad I didn''t enter this one because I can already tell I''d have NO chance.  Great job!', '2003-04-29 00:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(281564, 19596, 4494, '<td valign="top">I really like the frames you have around each pic, and the nice "main" frame.  THe shots are great as well.</td>', 'I really like the frames you have around each pic, and the nice "main" frame.  THe shots are great as well.', '2003-04-29 01:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(281565, 19737, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great!  What is really cool is the two "close ups" on the outside and then the reversed colors of them fighting in the middle pic.  I like the text also.</td>', 'Great!  What is really cool is the two "close ups" on the outside and then the reversed colors of them fighting in the middle pic.  I like the text also.', '2003-04-29 01:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(281567, 19652, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s kind of eery looking.  Great shots and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Wow, it''s kind of eery looking.  Great shots and interesting lighting.', '2003-04-29 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(281569, 19685, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Nice use of motion and lighting. The colours on the ground are very nice, especially the gradient to the near black background. I think the only thing that would have made this better is a blacker background. Excellent shot. Good luck!</td>', 'Very cool image. Nice use of motion and lighting. The colours on the ground are very nice, especially the gradient to the near black background. I think the only thing that would have made this better is a blacker background. Excellent shot. Good luck!', '2003-04-29 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(281570, 19731, 5007, '<td valign="top">Wow! I like this, neat textures that keep my eyes roving around taking everything in.</td>', 'Wow! I like this, neat textures that keep my eyes roving around taking everything in.', '2003-04-29 01:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281571, 19768, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very creative and delightful! Well done in every way.</td>', 'Very creative and delightful! Well done in every way.', '2003-04-29 01:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(281575, 19710, 5007, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and beautifully done!</td>', 'Excellent idea and beautifully done!', '2003-04-29 01:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(281576, 19712, 5044, '<td valign="top">It looks like a dream. I really like the softness these images have, which is accentuated by the drop shadow borders to each image. The colour scheme here is excellent. The only little thing is the overexposed sky. Good luck!</td>', 'It looks like a dream. I really like the softness these images have, which is accentuated by the drop shadow borders to each image. The colour scheme here is excellent. The only little thing is the overexposed sky. Good luck!', '2003-04-29 01:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(281578, 19579, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very clever and done well.</td>', 'Very clever and done well.', '2003-04-29 01:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(281580, 19694, 4494, '<td valign="top">Kind of boring because the shot in the middle and right are the same.  Should have been 3 completly different poses... maybe laying on the wall... jumping up and down, and then just standing there.</td>', 'Kind of boring because the shot in the middle and right are the same.  Should have been 3 completly different poses... maybe laying on the wall... jumping up and down, and then just standing there.', '2003-04-29 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(281581, 19584, 5007, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Neat idea done well.</td>', 'Sweet. Neat idea done well.', '2003-04-29 01:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(281583, 19725, 4494, '<td valign="top">The pictures aren''t that interesting or seem to be related in any way.</td>', 'The pictures aren''t that interesting or seem to be related in any way.', '2003-04-29 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(281585, 19406, 4494, '<td valign="top">The overall shot doesn''t give a clear sense of 2 or 3 "seperate" shots.</td>', 'The overall shot doesn''t give a clear sense of 2 or 3 "seperate" shots.', '2003-04-29 01:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(281586, 19716, 5007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love the textures and mix of lines. The sepia tone is perfect also.</td>', 'Beautiful. I love the textures and mix of lines. The sepia tone is perfect also.', '2003-04-29 01:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(281587, 19166, 5044, '<td valign="top">I  like each individual image. The focus on the bud could be a little stronger, and the tulip is a little overexposed. The shadows created are nice. My main problem is the fact that the two subjects are SO disproportioned, that they don''t meld together very well as one final image.</td>', 'I  like each individual image. The focus on the bud could be a little stronger, and the tulip is a little overexposed. The shadows created are nice. My main problem is the fact that the two subjects are SO disproportioned, that they don''t meld together very well as one final image.', '2003-04-29 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(281588, 19757, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good job getting the shots lined up that way.  Nice effect showing the 3 distinct weather patterns on the mountain.</td>', 'Good job getting the shots lined up that way.  Nice effect showing the 3 distinct weather patterns on the mountain.', '2003-04-29 01:14:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(281591, 19221, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like this but think it would be better without the words.</td>', 'I like this but think it would be better without the words.', '2003-04-29 01:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(281592, 19569, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well you obviously have some graphics design experience. :)  Great shot.  Love the green and black.</td>', 'Well you obviously have some graphics design experience. :)  Great shot.  Love the green and black.', '2003-04-29 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(281593, 19757, 5007, '<td valign="top">Great photo... I love how you show 3 faces of Rainier.</td>', 'Great photo... I love how you show 3 faces of Rainier.', '2003-04-29 01:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(281597, 19569, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very nice, looks like a poster.</td>', 'Very nice, looks like a poster.', '2003-04-29 01:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(281598, 19723, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that is really bizzare and thought provoking.  Excellent, moving shot!  9.</td>', 'Wow that is really bizzare and thought provoking.  Excellent, moving shot!  9.', '2003-04-29 01:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(281600, 19717, 5044, '<td valign="top">JJ, I really like your composition of these three (colour stripe=four?) images. The story is told perfectly. What I don''t like is the overexposed nature of the BW''s, and the use of such high contrast and saturation in the soccer players.  Still it all works very well. Good luck!</td>', 'JJ, I really like your composition of these three (colour stripe=four?) images. The story is told perfectly. What I don''t like is the overexposed nature of the BW''s, and the use of such high contrast and saturation in the soccer players.  Still it all works very well. Good luck!', '2003-04-29 01:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(281601, 19727, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like this, you did an excellent job of sequencing the pitch. I wish there was a way to line up the horizontal section in the upper half of the photos.</td>', 'I like this, you did an excellent job of sequencing the pitch. I wish there was a way to line up the horizontal section in the upper half of the photos.', '2003-04-29 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(281603, 19358, 5007, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2003-04-29 01:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(281605, 19685, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot and well done to boot.</td>', 'Very creative shot and well done to boot.', '2003-04-29 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(281608, 19723, 5044, '<td valign="top">Arni, yet another wonderful image. Very emotive. Nice use of aggressive cropping.</td>', 'Arni, yet another wonderful image. Very emotive. Nice use of aggressive cropping.', '2003-04-29 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(281609, 19690, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat... should have made the bottom pic of the horses running to the right, instead,  to "balance" it.  Nice effect on the middle shot.  I don''t really like the border however.  Good overall job.</td>', 'Pretty neat... should have made the bottom pic of the horses running to the right, instead,  to "balance" it.  Nice effect on the middle shot.  I don''t really like the border however.  Good overall job.', '2003-04-29 01:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(281610, 19652, 5007, '<td valign="top">Interesting study showing the similarity but individuality. Each photo is well done and could stand alone.</td>', 'Interesting study showing the similarity but individuality. Each photo is well done and could stand alone.', '2003-04-29 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(281611, 19739, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the abstract of it, and the great background colors of each shot.  Whoops, you cropped the middle pic a little too much (elbow).  8.</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the abstract of it, and the great background colors of each shot.  Whoops, you cropped the middle pic a little too much (elbow).  8.', '2003-04-29 01:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(281614, 19026, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great colors, excellent focus and composition. I like the framing and title as well.</td>', 'Nice. Great colors, excellent focus and composition. I like the framing and title as well.', '2003-04-29 01:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
