(281621, 19734, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty good... I like the way the arm on the middle image spans the two pictures.  Lighting is a little weak but it does have a nice glow (the yellow parts).</td>', 'Pretty good... I like the way the arm on the middle image spans the two pictures.  Lighting is a little weak but it does have a nice glow (the yellow parts).', '2003-04-29 01:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(281623, 19613, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like the green background, it fits well with the other colors of the shots.</td>', 'I like the green background, it fits well with the other colors of the shots.', '2003-04-29 01:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(281624, 19726, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like a poster from the 70''s.  Pretty good effects.</td>', 'Looks like a poster from the 70''s.  Pretty good effects.', '2003-04-29 01:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(281625, 19232, 4494, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the size of these pics are... Nice macro shots.  The iris has amazing detail.</td>', 'I wonder what the size of these pics are... Nice macro shots.  The iris has amazing detail.', '2003-04-29 01:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(281627, 19264, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well done for shots of amuzement rides.  I really like the green border with the dark and light areas.  The text font is a little bit too generic.</td>', 'Well done for shots of amuzement rides.  I really like the green border with the dark and light areas.  The text font is a little bit too generic.', '2003-04-29 01:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(281628, 19719, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like all the colors.... but maybe you should have cloned out the cars.  They are too distracting.  Very good idea however.  And the double image of the door is a little irratating... What you should have done is, in the blue pic, cropped it so half the door is showing, then that would have made a complete green and blue door. <br/></td>', 'I like all the colors.... but maybe you should have cloned out the cars.  They are too distracting.  Very good idea however.  And the double image of the door is a little irratating... What you should have done is, in the blue pic, cropped it so half the door is showing, then that would have made a complete green and blue door. ', '2003-04-29 01:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(281629, 19685, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s too hard to tell what''s going on here although it''s a good idea.</td>', 'It''s too hard to tell what''s going on here although it''s a good idea.', '2003-04-29 01:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(281631, 19750, 6855, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-04-29 01:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(281632, 19727, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great idea but one big flaw....  The dirt part on the top... all 3 pics should have the dirt exactly lined up.  Another cool idea would have been to give the middle pic a slight motion blur, then the right pic (last one) a larger motion blur.  :)  If only I could think of these ideas myself. :DDD</td>', 'Great idea but one big flaw....  The dirt part on the top... all 3 pics should have the dirt exactly lined up.  Another cool idea would have been to give the middle pic a slight motion blur, then the right pic (last one) a larger motion blur.  :)  If only I could think of these ideas myself. :DDD', '2003-04-29 01:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(281633, 19596, 6855, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Amazing macros!  Excellent job!  It''s refreshing to see some great photography as well as a great layout. Well done!</td>', 'WOW!  Amazing macros!  Excellent job!  It''s refreshing to see some great photography as well as a great layout. Well done!', '2003-04-29 01:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
