(281904, 19514, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like this one because it''s one of only a few multi-image compositions that tells a story (a FUN story!) ;) while not using three images of the same subject.  That''s nice, as is the cropping, though I''d have mirror-imaged the outside photos to bring it all inward..  It looks slightly desaturated on my monitor -- is that deliberate, or were the colors naturally muted?</td>', 'I like this one because it''s one of only a few multi-image compositions that tells a story (a FUN story!) ;) while not using three images of the same subject.  That''s nice, as is the cropping, though I''d have mirror-imaged the outside photos to bring it all inward..  It looks slightly desaturated on my monitor -- is that deliberate, or were the colors naturally muted?', '2003-04-29 12:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
