(281917, 19677, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good capture. The montage could have been more thought out though.</td>', 'Good capture. The montage could have been more thought out though.', '2003-04-29 13:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(281918, 19681, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nicest use of a vehicle/engine composite yet!</td>', 'Nicest use of a vehicle/engine composite yet!', '2003-04-29 13:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(281919, 19734, 5044, '<td valign="top">I find the images very dark and the black background makes them even darker. Perhaps a lighter colur BG would help.</td>', 'I find the images very dark and the black background makes them even darker. Perhaps a lighter colur BG would help.', '2003-04-29 13:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(281921, 19616, 6565, '<td valign="top">Talk about your inside jokes!  Very cute! :)</td>', 'Talk about your inside jokes!  Very cute! :)', '2003-04-29 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(281922, 19616, 5044, '<td valign="top">You''ve got the proper tool (S602Z), now just go out and shoot, shoot, shoot!</td>', 'You''ve got the proper tool (S602Z), now just go out and shoot, shoot, shoot!', '2003-04-29 13:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(281924, 19278, 5044, '<td valign="top">What in the world is that Toyota doing in this picture. Not the same class of car. Well done but I would have prefered to see the real things.</td>', 'What in the world is that Toyota doing in this picture. Not the same class of car. Well done but I would have prefered to see the real things.', '2003-04-29 13:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(281925, 19415, 4536, '<td valign="top">I like your presentation. Nice photos that would stand out on their own individually too. To me the water motion does not represent "stillness", but that''s just me.</td>', 'I like your presentation. Nice photos that would stand out on their own individually too. To me the water motion does not represent "stillness", but that''s just me.', '2003-04-29 13:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(281926, 19355, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nicely done. I can almost smell the soil.</td>', 'Nice idea and nicely done. I can almost smell the soil.', '2003-04-29 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(281928, 19596, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice drops. Perhaps a tad bright ain the highlights but pleasing to look at nevertheless.</td>', 'Nice drops. Perhaps a tad bright ain the highlights but pleasing to look at nevertheless.', '2003-04-29 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(281929, 19221, 5044, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wondeful triptych, but the text ruins it for me. I would love to see this one without the title so prominent.</td>', 'I think this is a wondeful triptych, but the text ruins it for me. I would love to see this one without the title so prominent.', '2003-04-29 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(281933, 19750, 3290, '<td valign="top">Peaceful, but I find the text distracting.</td>', 'Peaceful, but I find the text distracting.', '2003-04-29 13:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(281934, 19750, 3882, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote in this challenge, but I wanted to say what a wonderful composition you made here.  Looks like an add for a magazine or something!  Great Job!</td>', 'I can''t vote in this challenge, but I wanted to say what a wonderful composition you made here.  Looks like an add for a magazine or something!  Great Job!', '2003-04-29 13:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(281936, 19757, 5044, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, sorry, shots! How long did you have to wait to get these 3 different skies? Great patience. The images, especially the first, could stand a little cleaning (Neatimage) as there seems to be quite a bit of Noise in them. A wonderful composition.</td>', 'This is a great shot, sorry, shots! How long did you have to wait to get these 3 different skies? Great patience. The images, especially the first, could stand a little cleaning (Neatimage) as there seems to be quite a bit of Noise in them. A wonderful composition.', '2003-04-29 13:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(281937, 19767, 4536, '<td valign="top">Very nice, shows a story well. The shots are a bit grey and could use some more contrast.</td>', 'Very nice, shows a story well. The shots are a bit grey and could use some more contrast.', '2003-04-29 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(281939, 19250, 4536, '<td valign="top">very nice collection of shots. I like the way you put them together too. The only nit pic is the corners on the middle shot, they look too computerized, IMO.</td>', 'very nice collection of shots. I like the way you put them together too. The only nit pic is the corners on the middle shot, they look too computerized, IMO.', '2003-04-29 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(281942, 19499, 3290, '<td valign="top">It''s a little hard to make sense of - some of the images look like they''re upside down. I particularly like the top image, though.</td>', 'It''s a little hard to make sense of - some of the images look like they''re upside down. I particularly like the top image, though.', '2003-04-29 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(281943, 19613, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of scale.</td>', 'Nice sense of scale.', '2003-04-29 13:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(281945, 19716, 3290, '<td valign="top">Some nice geometry, and monochrome was a good choice.</td>', 'Some nice geometry, and monochrome was a good choice.', '2003-04-29 13:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(281946, 19727, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice use of burst mode. I like the pose in the centre picture.</td>', 'Nice use of burst mode. I like the pose in the centre picture.', '2003-04-29 13:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(281947, 19221, 3290, '<td valign="top">I really like the images in this, but I really don''t like the text. The upper right image is very nice - looks like the seeds are about to blow away.</td>', 'I really like the images in this, but I really don''t like the text. The upper right image is very nice - looks like the seeds are about to blow away.', '2003-04-29 13:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(281948, 19681, 3290, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. The reflections on the bonnet get in the way of seeing the engine, though.</td>', 'Clever idea. The reflections on the bonnet get in the way of seeing the engine, though.', '2003-04-29 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(281950, 19688, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. How did you get the cruet to levitate? :-)</td>', 'Cool. How did you get the cruet to levitate? :-)', '2003-04-29 13:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(281951, 19358, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great emotion in this one. In fact, the picture edges almost get in the way of what looks like a very nice picture in its own right.</td>', 'Great emotion in this one. In fact, the picture edges almost get in the way of what looks like a very nice picture in its own right.', '2003-04-29 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(281954, 19680, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower and good shots, but I find the borders a little overpowering.</td>', 'Pretty flower and good shots, but I find the borders a little overpowering.', '2003-04-29 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(281955, 19627, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very effective.</td>', 'Very effective.', '2003-04-29 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281956, 19501, 3290, '<td valign="top">Aaaahhhh.</td>', 'Aaaahhhh.', '2003-04-29 13:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(281958, 19059, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great expressions</td>', 'Great expressions', '2003-04-29 13:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(281959, 19684, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo, the join is "too good", as I really thought this was a single photo.  Very eirie, good "setting of the mood".  Perhaps a little too much light on the woman''s forehead (she''s a vampire, you know).  I now see the repeated books.  Damn, I hate missing "clues".  Score upgrade to 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very well taken photo, the join is "too good", as I really thought this was a single photo.  Very eirie, good "setting of the mood".  Perhaps a little too much light on the woman''s forehead (she''s a vampire, you know).  I now see the repeated books.  Damn, I hate missing "clues".  Score upgrade to 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 13:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(281961, 19764, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Beautiful colours.</td>', 'Very pretty. Beautiful colours.', '2003-04-29 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(281962, 19769, 3290, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2003-04-29 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(281963, 19749, 6025, '<td valign="top">I like the use of extreme contrast and the empty space - it kind of reads "more to follow", as if it is an incomplete story. Good work.</td>', 'I like the use of extreme contrast and the empty space - it kind of reads "more to follow", as if it is an incomplete story. Good work.', '2003-04-29 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(281965, 19236, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, but there''s a lot of empty space in the composition.</td>', 'Great expressions, but there''s a lot of empty space in the composition.', '2003-04-29 13:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(281966, 19579, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and I like the ''film'' effect. Good one. Would probably be better if the model were looking at the camera, but I like the way she''s looking at herself in the rightmost shot.</td>', 'Great idea, and I like the ''film'' effect. Good one. Would probably be better if the model were looking at the camera, but I like the way she''s looking at herself in the rightmost shot.', '2003-04-29 13:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(281969, 19736, 1005, '<td valign="top">Oh, I see the ant!  I like this.  Butterflies are very difficult to satisfy "the masses".  The big ones are easier to get a shot of, but offer a surprisingly large photo surface.  The tail section being totally out of focus is going to "bug" some (it''s not that easy!!).  This looks like my Morphio jelendian, but smaller.  I like the negative view.  The b&amp;w view seems non-descript.  The color view seems a bit muted.  <br/>Still, all that said, I like this series and gave it a 9 before I knew who did it.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Oh, I see the ant!  I like this.  Butterflies are very difficult to satisfy "the masses".  The big ones are easier to get a shot of, but offer a surprisingly large photo surface.  The tail section being totally out of focus is going to "bug" some (it''s not that easy!!).  This looks like my Morphio jelendian, but smaller.  I like the negative view.  The b&w view seems non-descript.  The color view seems a bit muted.  Still, all that said, I like this series and gave it a 9 before I knew who did it.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(281974, 19091, 772, '<td valign="top">I definitely like railroad theme photos :)  This one is quite interesting as well... they layout is nice and the lines all seem to work nicely together... excellent work :) - setzler</td>', 'I definitely like railroad theme photos :)  This one is quite interesting as well... they layout is nice and the lines all seem to work nicely together... excellent work :) - setzler', '2003-04-29 14:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(281975, 19717, 4536, '<td valign="top">Heavy story. Not sure I like the treatments to the photos, but it still is a strong tryptic.</td>', 'Heavy story. Not sure I like the treatments to the photos, but it still is a strong tryptic.', '2003-04-29 14:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281976, 19429, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, but I think this does not meet the criteria for a diptych. Very well done, nonetheless.</td>', 'Very nice image, but I think this does not meet the criteria for a diptych. Very well done, nonetheless.', '2003-04-29 14:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(281978, 19763, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great expressions!</td>', 'Great expressions!', '2003-04-29 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281979, 19736, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the images but I wish there was more seperation of the images, as well as a little something of a border.</td>', 'I like the images but I wish there was more seperation of the images, as well as a little something of a border.', '2003-04-29 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281982, 19764, 4517, '<td valign="top">3 good images from day to night with a nice simple layout. Looks very professional.8</td>', '3 good images from day to night with a nice simple layout. Looks very professional.8', '2003-04-29 14:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(282000, 19250, 5044, '<td valign="top">Well done. I''m not crazy about all the extra white but I don''t see how else you could have done it. Perhaps a second smaller border, with some colour separating the two might have helped. As it stands, it seems unfinished.</td>', 'Well done. I''m not crazy about all the extra white but I don''t see how else you could have done it. Perhaps a second smaller border, with some colour separating the two might have helped. As it stands, it seems unfinished.', '2003-04-29 14:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(282003, 19584, 5044, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!</td>', 'Congratulations!', '2003-04-29 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(282010, 19550, 7800, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous pictures. I don''t love the way you framed them though, they look like they are just floating in the white space. I''d rather have seen a more traditional composition.</td>', 'Gorgeous pictures. I don''t love the way you framed them though, they look like they are just floating in the white space. I''d rather have seen a more traditional composition.', '2003-04-29 14:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(282014, 19596, 7800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture! I wish the background of the frame was black or white; I think the pattern takes a way from the images a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful picture! I wish the background of the frame was black or white; I think the pattern takes a way from the images a bit.', '2003-04-29 14:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(282017, 19587, 5044, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what went on here, but it seems quite disturbing.</td>', 'I don''t know what went on here, but it seems quite disturbing.', '2003-04-29 14:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(282018, 19429, 7800, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see him one more time back up the road a ways. Maybe sitting down would have been neat. Good job though. Love the colors and the sky.</td>', 'I wish I could see him one more time back up the road a ways. Maybe sitting down would have been neat. Good job though. Love the colors and the sky.', '2003-04-29 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(282020, 19059, 7800, '<td valign="top">Awesome captures of grandpa and a beautiful granddaughter. It bothers me a bit that the title describes something that I can''t see happening.</td>', 'Awesome captures of grandpa and a beautiful granddaughter. It bothers me a bit that the title describes something that I can''t see happening.', '2003-04-29 14:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(282021, 19579, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very interresting picture. I''m really not sure how you did it, but I like this very much.</td>', 'Very interresting picture. I''m really not sure how you did it, but I like this very much.', '2003-04-29 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(282022, 19755, 7800, '<td valign="top">Hee. Your title fits the image perfectly!</td>', 'Hee. Your title fits the image perfectly!', '2003-04-29 14:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(282025, 19569, 7800, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely. Looks totally professional. : )</td>', 'Absolutely lovely. Looks totally professional. : )', '2003-04-29 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(282026, 19764, 7800, '<td valign="top">What a great idea. Absolutely gorgeous!  I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'What a great idea. Absolutely gorgeous!  I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2003-04-29 14:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(282027, 19690, 5044, '<td valign="top">How do you get a shot like this without being trampled by the horses? A little too much PS for this one.</td>', 'How do you get a shot like this without being trampled by the horses? A little too much PS for this one.', '2003-04-29 14:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(282029, 19719, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot. I can see that it is sections of three different pictures, as if to create a panoramic pic. The colours use is nice. The problem I see is the different perspective and angles on the line of the roof. Because they were taken from the same place, the roof line does not follow. Other than that, it is a great shot.</td>', 'I like this shot alot. I can see that it is sections of three different pictures, as if to create a panoramic pic. The colours use is nice. The problem I see is the different perspective and angles on the line of the roof. Because they were taken from the same place, the roof line does not follow. Other than that, it is a great shot.', '2003-04-29 14:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(282031, 19415, 7800, '<td valign="top">I love this. The black and white shots look perfect to me. The only reason I''m not giving you a 10 is because the middle shot doesn''t evoke stillness to me. For some reason I''m seeing choppy waters and a boat that lost it''s crew.</td>', 'I love this. The black and white shots look perfect to me. The only reason I''m not giving you a 10 is because the middle shot doesn''t evoke stillness to me. For some reason I''m seeing choppy waters and a boat that lost it''s crew.', '2003-04-29 14:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(282033, 19579, 6900, '<td valign="top">Familiar looking model.<br/>Great composition and use of the editing rules.  Interesting idea!  :)  I don''t like the second pose/facial expression, but don''t tell her I said that!  Excellent job.</td>', 'Familiar looking model.Great composition and use of the editing rules.  Interesting idea!  :)  I don''t like the second pose/facial expression, but don''t tell her I said that!  Excellent job.', '2003-04-29 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1);
