(282161, 19553, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and tulip. I wish the second panel had something more new to say about the tulip. Lovely tones and colors, too.</td>', 'Lovely light and tulip. I wish the second panel had something more new to say about the tulip. Lovely tones and colors, too.', '2003-04-29 15:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(282164, 19765, 7800, '<td valign="top">Wow. So gorgeous. I wouldn''t change a thing from your beautiful pictures to your frame or choice of font. Good Job!</td>', 'Wow. So gorgeous. I wouldn''t change a thing from your beautiful pictures to your frame or choice of font. Good Job!', '2003-04-29 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(282165, 19360, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrasts between panels. Nice use of light and B/W! Super work here. 10</td>', 'Very nice contrasts between panels. Nice use of light and B/W! Super work here. 10', '2003-04-29 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(282178, 19652, 2667, '<td valign="top">Excellent black and white work. Nice use of the multi image theme as well. One of my favorites this week. 10</td>', 'Excellent black and white work. Nice use of the multi image theme as well. One of my favorites this week. 10', '2003-04-29 15:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(282190, 19712, 714, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like the softness of it.  Colors are very nice and calming.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like the softness of it.  Colors are very nice and calming.', '2003-04-29 15:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(282195, 19569, 7190, '<td valign="top">Really like everything but here it comes. i uderstand  and like the idea od breaking the boundaries with the leaf. On the left side great but the truncating the leaf on the left really bothers me for some reason. maybe because it gives me a feeling of unbalance for an image that should be in balance.</td>', 'Really like everything but here it comes. i uderstand  and like the idea od breaking the boundaries with the leaf. On the left side great but the truncating the leaf on the left really bothers me for some reason. maybe because it gives me a feeling of unbalance for an image that should be in balance.', '2003-04-29 15:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(282206, 19717, 3459, '<td valign="top">THe best image of the challenge, I would make it a winner!  I think the under/over exposure are the perfect tools here, used masterfully.  Congrats on an excellent, excellent image!</td>', 'THe best image of the challenge, I would make it a winner!  I think the under/over exposure are the perfect tools here, used masterfully.  Congrats on an excellent, excellent image!', '2003-04-29 16:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(282210, 19166, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''m distracted by the green in the bottom right of the first shot.</td>', 'I''m distracted by the green in the bottom right of the first shot.', '2003-04-29 16:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(282213, 19662, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like the staggered effect.</td>', 'I like the staggered effect.', '2003-04-29 16:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(282214, 19668, 7350, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very sad, dirty harbor.</td>', 'Looks like a very sad, dirty harbor.', '2003-04-29 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(282221, 19258, 7350, '<td valign="top">Looks like Chicago.  Am I right?</td>', 'Looks like Chicago.  Am I right?', '2003-04-29 16:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(282223, 19587, 7350, '<td valign="top">Disgusting.</td>', 'Disgusting.', '2003-04-29 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(282225, 19616, 7350, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I''d kill for 201/229!</td>', 'Sometimes I''d kill for 201/229!', '2003-04-29 16:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(282233, 19768, 2223, '<td valign="top"><br/>thats freakin adorable!! i love it! 10!!!!</td>', 'thats freakin adorable!! i love it! 10!!!!', '2003-04-29 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(282238, 19221, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far. It''s perfect. Quality of pics is high and the presentation  has a very nice polish. Also, the multi-image presentation make sense here, unlike with so many other submissions. Beautiful layout, like the Breaking Free, tucked in the middle, with a nice font. This image is so playful and everybody can relate to the wonders and fun of blowing these things. A very well-deserved 10 Journey</td>', 'This is my favorite so far. It''s perfect. Quality of pics is high and the presentation  has a very nice polish. Also, the multi-image presentation make sense here, unlike with so many other submissions. Beautiful layout, like the Breaking Free, tucked in the middle, with a nice font. This image is so playful and everybody can relate to the wonders and fun of blowing these things. A very well-deserved 10 Journey', '2003-04-29 16:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(282240, 19731, 3294, '<td valign="top">I''m not totally sure what is on the left there, but I like the contrast in textures and shapes.  I think this might have been interesting in color as well.</td>', 'I''m not totally sure what is on the left there, but I like the contrast in textures and shapes.  I think this might have been interesting in color as well.', '2003-04-29 16:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(282242, 19768, 3294, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Are the bubbles a filter?  Not sure.  I like the arm stretched out... brings the eyes back to the bottom of an otherwise top heavy submission.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Are the bubbles a filter?  Not sure.  I like the arm stretched out... brings the eyes back to the bottom of an otherwise top heavy submission.', '2003-04-29 16:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(282244, 19620, 2586, '<td valign="top">Another great advertisement. Quality of the pictures is great, particularly like the top left one. What i really appreciate, too, is the border. Its pattern comes from part of the label! Wonder whether you used pattern maker for that (and at a detail level of 15) or whether you did some cut and paste and ''transform-scale'' for it. Well done, 10 Journey</td>', 'Another great advertisement. Quality of the pictures is great, particularly like the top left one. What i really appreciate, too, is the border. Its pattern comes from part of the label! Wonder whether you used pattern maker for that (and at a detail level of 15) or whether you did some cut and paste and ''transform-scale'' for it. Well done, 10 Journey', '2003-04-29 16:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(282245, 19726, 2586, '<td valign="top">Magic indeed. Fun to contemplate. Nice images, particularly with the reddish glow and the grain which all adds to the magic. Nice, smooth, and effective presentation. A real multi-image. 10 Journey</td>', 'Magic indeed. Fun to contemplate. Nice images, particularly with the reddish glow and the grain which all adds to the magic. Nice, smooth, and effective presentation. A real multi-image. 10 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(282247, 19674, 2586, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective, fun presentation. A real multi-image! Even though i don''t drink beer, i appreciate this image. The text below is fun too. Good pictures of the beer. 9 Journey</td>', 'Simple, effective, fun presentation. A real multi-image! Even though i don''t drink beer, i appreciate this image. The text below is fun too. Good pictures of the beer. 9 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(282250, 19278, 2586, '<td valign="top">My dream car is a black Porsche, so what can i say? :) Nice slick presentation. Good pictures (some artifacts on the 996 but that''s due to the enormous resizing, i think).  A real multi-image. 9 Journey</td>', 'My dream car is a black Porsche, so what can i say? :) Nice slick presentation. Good pictures (some artifacts on the 996 but that''s due to the enormous resizing, i think).  A real multi-image. 9 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(282254, 19710, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is relly fun. Here the multi-image doesn''t tell a story or show a sequence of events but is effective in underscoring the degree of loving. Nice attention to detail by lining up the arms so well. Very fun and very clean. 8 Journey</td>', 'This is relly fun. Here the multi-image doesn''t tell a story or show a sequence of events but is effective in underscoring the degree of loving. Nice attention to detail by lining up the arms so well. Very fun and very clean. 8 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(282256, 19769, 2586, '<td valign="top">There''s another submission in the same vein and i like them both. What''s very effective here is all the black and the thin white borders. Putting all those body parts in boxes, underscore the sense of feeling disconnected. Well thought out and well done. 8 Journey</td>', 'There''s another submission in the same vein and i like them both. What''s very effective here is all the black and the thin white borders. Putting all those body parts in boxes, underscore the sense of feeling disconnected. Well thought out and well done. 8 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(282288, 19677, 2586, '<td valign="top">Entertaining. Effective multi-image because it shows the sequence of events. Tough pictures to crop (guy in left pic has his head chopped off a little). Nice pics, love the splash on the right. It''s rather skimpy on the layout side since you must have opted for max. image sizes and it makes it look like a movie clip.  Would have liked to see some bg space between the pics and that cool title on the bg. Would have been enough space if you had cropped the boat off??? 7 Journey</td>', 'Entertaining. Effective multi-image because it shows the sequence of events. Tough pictures to crop (guy in left pic has his head chopped off a little). Nice pics, love the splash on the right. It''s rather skimpy on the layout side since you must have opted for max. image sizes and it makes it look like a movie clip.  Would have liked to see some bg space between the pics and that cool title on the bg. Would have been enough space if you had cropped the boat off??? 7 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(282291, 19723, 2586, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite understand it, must be Existentialism :) It''s dark and gloomy; i like it. I like how you used that cross and the very blurred image to capture the ''demise''. Don''t you know blurred images get creamed at dpc? :) Haunting portrait in the middle. Love how everything is black and white except for those blue, blue eyes. These people seem very icelandic to me. Are you who i think you are? 9 Journey<br/>Upped to a 10 - love the artisticity of this image.</td>', 'Don''t quite understand it, must be Existentialism :) It''s dark and gloomy; i like it. I like how you used that cross and the very blurred image to capture the ''demise''. Don''t you know blurred images get creamed at dpc? :) Haunting portrait in the middle. Love how everything is black and white except for those blue, blue eyes. These people seem very icelandic to me. Are you who i think you are? 9 JourneyUpped to a 10 - love the artisticity of this image.', '2003-04-29 17:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(282294, 19360, 2586, '<td valign="top">Cool expressions, nice portraits. I like the subtle minimalism here with a lot of white space. Also like the blurred drop shadows, looks like you used a gradient? even though it caused some banding. 7 Journey</td>', 'Cool expressions, nice portraits. I like the subtle minimalism here with a lot of white space. Also like the blurred drop shadows, looks like you used a gradient? even though it caused some banding. 7 Journey', '2003-04-29 17:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
