(283496, 19569, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling to this image. composition wise, I feel the elements are a little too compartimented. perhaps your subject on the left could have filled the space more generously without being enclosed in a frame. The two "cartouches" on the right are nice but the different widths of framing could have been avoided. if you created these borders using the "increase canvas size method", remember not to use uneven numbers of pixels to do so. 8</td>', 'Nice feeling to this image. composition wise, I feel the elements are a little too compartimented. perhaps your subject on the left could have filled the space more generously without being enclosed in a frame. The two "cartouches" on the right are nice but the different widths of framing could have been avoided. if you created these borders using the "increase canvas size method", remember not to use uneven numbers of pixels to do so. 8', '2003-04-30 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
