(284231, 19358, 3294, '<td valign="top">nice intimate moment captured.  Although I disagree with the framing style.  The dark lines across the child''s face is a shame.  I really like the lighting on the photo... very soft and warm, even being b/w.</td>', 'nice intimate moment captured.  Although I disagree with the framing style.  The dark lines across the child''s face is a shame.  I really like the lighting on the photo... very soft and warm, even being b/w.', '2003-04-30 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(284235, 19584, 3294, '<td valign="top">My clear favorite for the challenge.  The first thing I noticed was that all three photos seemed to have dark bottom-left and top-right corners.  Reminds me of photos that belong in a locket on a necklace.  If I were to direct this photoshoot and do something different, it would be to show the baby''s open eyes in each shot... while maintaining the other''s eyes not being shown, as they look down.  Great work.  My only 10.</td>', 'My clear favorite for the challenge.  The first thing I noticed was that all three photos seemed to have dark bottom-left and top-right corners.  Reminds me of photos that belong in a locket on a necklace.  If I were to direct this photoshoot and do something different, it would be to show the baby''s open eyes in each shot... while maintaining the other''s eyes not being shown, as they look down.  Great work.  My only 10.', '2003-04-30 23:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(284240, 19587, 3294, '<td valign="top">heh heh!  You are prolly getting SLAMMED for this one.  Although the scene does look a little staged, I lke the theme.  And it definitely works better b/w than in color.</td>', 'heh heh!  You are prolly getting SLAMMED for this one.  Although the scene does look a little staged, I lke the theme.  And it definitely works better b/w than in color.', '2003-04-30 23:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
