(284898, 19276, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cute series and it tells a story, too.  The bird bath scene is distinguishable, but can''t really see the bird (it''s the brown spot, right?).   Cat Food scene is so very cute and the cleanup, just too cat-like.  All three scenes are sharp, but so small the detail is difficult to see.  I try to stay away from frame comments, but I''m sorry, this color isn''t really pleasant (no score affect).  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really cute series and it tells a story, too.  The bird bath scene is distinguishable, but can''t really see the bird (it''s the brown spot, right?).   Cat Food scene is so very cute and the cleanup, just too cat-like.  All three scenes are sharp, but so small the detail is difficult to see.  I try to stay away from frame comments, but I''m sorry, this color isn''t really pleasant (no score affect).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-01 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
