(285434, 19569, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice touch with the bamboo leaves going out of the frame. Still trying to figure out how to do it. Good individual images and composition of the three.</td>', 'Nice touch with the bamboo leaves going out of the frame. Still trying to figure out how to do it. Good individual images and composition of the three.', '2003-05-01 23:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(285451, 19596, 7901, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I love how the water magnifies the berries, also the reflections they give off. Didn''t like the textured background too much (the gray). Great work none-the-less. <br/></td>', 'Excellent shot. I love how the water magnifies the berries, also the reflections they give off. Didn''t like the textured background too much (the gray). Great work none-the-less. ', '2003-05-01 23:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(285468, 19717, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the top 2 pictures ok.  The bottom photo is just too dark and oversaturated.  The dirt on the player is blue slightly.  I''m rendering a guess as to who took this photo....</td>', 'I like the top 2 pictures ok.  The bottom photo is just too dark and oversaturated.  The dirt on the player is blue slightly.  I''m rendering a guess as to who took this photo....', '2003-05-02 00:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(285471, 19710, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if or how this fits the challenge, but it''s a darn nice photo.  Very well concieived and well excecuted.  Nice work</td>', 'I don''t know if or how this fits the challenge, but it''s a darn nice photo.  Very well concieived and well excecuted.  Nice work', '2003-05-02 00:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(285474, 19501, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how these photos are arranged at all.  The extra space at the bottom is really distracting to the photos, which are very cute btw.  Adorable - When they sleep anyway. :)  THis is a good idea and one of the only ones to really meet the challenge IMO.</td>', 'I don''t like how these photos are arranged at all.  The extra space at the bottom is really distracting to the photos, which are very cute btw.  Adorable - When they sleep anyway. :)  THis is a good idea and one of the only ones to really meet the challenge IMO.', '2003-05-02 00:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(285499, 19680, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''d have changed the angle of the top pic and turned it toward the right more to keep it more consistent with the bottom 2 images.  Great idea and almost really well done.</td>', 'I''d have changed the angle of the top pic and turned it toward the right more to keep it more consistent with the bottom 2 images.  Great idea and almost really well done.', '2003-05-02 00:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(285503, 19765, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like the postcard shot as much as it does triptych.  Good vibrant colors. I really like the flower in the last frame.  Very nice</td>', 'This looks like the postcard shot as much as it does triptych.  Good vibrant colors. I really like the flower in the last frame.  Very nice', '2003-05-02 00:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(285509, 19672, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs just a little tiny bit more focus to make it a really strong photo.  I like the idea very much though.  Nice job.</td>', 'This needs just a little tiny bit more focus to make it a really strong photo.  I like the idea very much though.  Nice job.', '2003-05-02 00:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(285517, 19723, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, love the effect of the subtle blue eyes.  Great job!</td>', 'Very dramatic, love the effect of the subtle blue eyes.  Great job!', '2003-05-02 00:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(285520, 19026, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice layout and color, love those mirrors!  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Nice layout and color, love those mirrors!  Very nicely done!', '2003-05-02 00:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(285523, 19737, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very cool.... Oh the memories.  Great job with choice of layout, fonts, and composition.  Super!</td>', 'Very cool.... Oh the memories.  Great job with choice of layout, fonts, and composition.  Super!', '2003-05-02 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(285525, 19690, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely done....  love the brushed effect!</td>', 'Nicely done....  love the brushed effect!', '2003-05-02 00:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(285528, 19221, 6600, '<td valign="top">Love the photos.... great title!  Super job!</td>', 'Love the photos.... great title!  Super job!', '2003-05-02 00:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(285531, 19688, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice job putting them together.... match up well.</td>', 'Nice job putting them together.... match up well.', '2003-05-02 00:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(285536, 19717, 6600, '<td valign="top">Lovely shots with great emotion.  Good job.</td>', 'Lovely shots with great emotion.  Good job.', '2003-05-02 00:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(285543, 19569, 6600, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and layout. (Would help me out with my Feng Shui)</td>', 'Interesting composition and layout. (Would help me out with my Feng Shui)', '2003-05-02 01:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(285545, 19302, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great car!  Nicely layed out, good composition.  Nice color.  Great job!</td>', 'Great car!  Nicely layed out, good composition.  Nice color.  Great job!', '2003-05-02 01:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(285547, 19768, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Great job with the bubbles.  Superb!</td>', 'Very nice!  Great job with the bubbles.  Superb!', '2003-05-02 01:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(285551, 19579, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea with great implementation.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool idea with great implementation.  Nicely done!', '2003-05-02 01:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(285574, 19579, 2389, '<td valign="top">This is a really clever idea, and I like the changes in the subject''s expression.</td>', 'This is a really clever idea, and I like the changes in the subject''s expression.', '2003-05-02 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(285582, 19757, 2389, '<td valign="top">My favorite mountain. Nice transition from Fog to Overcast. The frame on the left with no clouds has a lot of noise, but other than that, no complaints.</td>', 'My favorite mountain. Nice transition from Fog to Overcast. The frame on the left with no clouds has a lot of noise, but other than that, no complaints.', '2003-05-02 01:27:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(285584, 19576, 2389, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle transitions between the pictures. This effect is unique among all the submissions.</td>', 'Nice subtle transitions between the pictures. This effect is unique among all the submissions.', '2003-05-02 01:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(285589, 19280, 2389, '<td valign="top">Good expressions on the cat. I don''t care for what looks like a ring of light on the black background at the top. It pulls my eyes away from the real subjects.</td>', 'Good expressions on the cat. I don''t care for what looks like a ring of light on the black background at the top. It pulls my eyes away from the real subjects.', '2003-05-02 01:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(285591, 19719, 2389, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I would have liked this better if the three pieces were better aligned. Nice idea with the colors...</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I would have liked this better if the three pieces were better aligned. Nice idea with the colors...', '2003-05-02 01:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(285592, 19331, 2389, '<td valign="top">nice idea with the change in color saturation along with the change in zoom...</td>', 'nice idea with the change in color saturation along with the change in zoom...', '2003-05-02 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(285604, 19620, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice details, lighting, setup, everything.  oh yeah, and subject.</td>', 'very nice details, lighting, setup, everything.  oh yeah, and subject.', '2003-05-02 01:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(285605, 19514, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice idea and well executed.  the salt has a yellow tinge to it which might have been helped with adjusting your white balance, but that''s just a nit, i really like the combination (in your photo and in real life ;-)</td>', 'nice idea and well executed.  the salt has a yellow tinge to it which might have been helped with adjusting your white balance, but that''s just a nit, i really like the combination (in your photo and in real life ;-)', '2003-05-02 01:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(285611, 19757, 7970, '<td valign="top">Very nice &amp; neat work. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Very nice & neat work. Thanks for sharing.', '2003-05-02 01:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(285625, 19278, 3607, '<td valign="top">and you own them all!  nicely done.  you might have takent the shots on a black plasterboard and not had the stand visible in the photo, but the combination of the shots is very well done.</td>', 'and you own them all!  nicely done.  you might have takent the shots on a black plasterboard and not had the stand visible in the photo, but the combination of the shots is very well done.', '2003-05-02 02:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(285632, 19276, 3607, '<td valign="top">i love the sequence, but the focus seems soft, the photos are not quite sized/aligned right, and the pea soup green background?  the photo on the right says it all ;-)</td>', 'i love the sequence, but the focus seems soft, the photos are not quite sized/aligned right, and the pea soup green background?  the photo on the right says it all ;-)', '2003-05-02 02:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(285636, 19553, 3607, '<td valign="top">the photos are very well done, i don''t understand why you sized them differently, i think the . . . . oh, they are the same photo reversed.  neat idea, but still i think the final product fell short of its potential.</td>', 'the photos are very well done, i don''t understand why you sized them differently, i think the . . . . oh, they are the same photo reversed.  neat idea, but still i think the final product fell short of its potential.', '2003-05-02 02:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(285639, 19407, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the golden lines lead upward and frame the center frame. Lots of interesting lines here!</td>', 'I like how the golden lines lead upward and frame the center frame. Lots of interesting lines here!', '2003-05-02 02:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(285640, 19728, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun image. I kind of wish you''d have used three kids. But that''s a small matter, this is enjoyable!</td>', 'Fun image. I kind of wish you''d have used three kids. But that''s a small matter, this is enjoyable!', '2003-05-02 02:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(285642, 19717, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the extremes in saturation and exposure here. It adds a feeling of artistic action. The three frames work well together, though the folks in the upper left frame seem to be looking, at first, at the guy with the  umbrella. 9</td>', 'I really enjoy the extremes in saturation and exposure here. It adds a feeling of artistic action. The three frames work well together, though the folks in the upper left frame seem to be looking, at first, at the guy with the  umbrella. 9', '2003-05-02 02:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(285644, 19685, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dividing this shot into three helps bring a scientific dissection mood to things. Very appropriate. 9</td>', 'Dividing this shot into three helps bring a scientific dissection mood to things. Very appropriate. 9', '2003-05-02 02:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(285646, 19760, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work! I think "awaits" needs a noun to act upon, so "Heaven Waits" may be more appropriate. But that''s from grading all of my student papers this semester. the tones and contrasts here work well, and I like how the frames added together make synergy.</td>', 'Nice work! I think "awaits" needs a noun to act upon, so "Heaven Waits" may be more appropriate. But that''s from grading all of my student papers this semester. the tones and contrasts here work well, and I like how the frames added together make synergy.', '2003-05-02 02:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(285648, 19641, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors here. Each frame brings something new to behold, wtih the center frame getting, appropriately, most of the attention. Nice work. If it''s to be improved, I would aim for a bit more mood through your lighting. Still high marks from me. Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice colors here. Each frame brings something new to behold, wtih the center frame getting, appropriately, most of the attention. Nice work. If it''s to be improved, I would aim for a bit more mood through your lighting. Still high marks from me. Nice job.', '2003-05-02 02:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(285651, 19767, 6870, '<td valign="top">The frames work well together, though the center and right are similar enough when the bird is so dissimilar. Still very nice tones and gentle colors. Nice work!</td>', 'The frames work well together, though the center and right are similar enough when the bird is so dissimilar. Still very nice tones and gentle colors. Nice work!', '2003-05-02 02:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(285652, 19672, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really engaging and fascinating juxaposition here, and your bold and simple approach really works well. Not quite sharp on my monitor, but what great work!</td>', 'Really engaging and fascinating juxaposition here, and your bold and simple approach really works well. Not quite sharp on my monitor, but what great work!', '2003-05-02 02:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(285654, 19619, 6870, '<td valign="top">Closer and closer and closer work well here. the images seem slightly over exposed or over processed or something, especially the upper left tulips, which look like too  much unsharp mask was used. Composition is wonderful, and the black background really sets off the colors.</td>', 'Closer and closer and closer work well here. the images seem slightly over exposed or over processed or something, especially the upper left tulips, which look like too  much unsharp mask was used. Composition is wonderful, and the black background really sets off the colors.', '2003-05-02 02:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(285655, 19203, 6870, '<td valign="top">These little flowers are sure fun when they pop out of the ground so early, aren''t they! Focus is great, though both shots, but especially the left could use just a little more contrast in the petals, I feel. The frames work well together. Nice, soft lighting.</td>', 'These little flowers are sure fun when they pop out of the ground so early, aren''t they! Focus is great, though both shots, but especially the left could use just a little more contrast in the petals, I feel. The frames work well together. Nice, soft lighting.', '2003-05-02 02:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(285656, 19576, 3607, '<td valign="top">these images are amazing.  the detail is great, the ''work'' is at the same time obvious but subtle.  i have to say though, that the merging of the three images rather than framing each one reduces the effectiveness of the final photo a bit (or maybe if they hadn''t been merged so well and some seperation between each photo was more obvious).  regardless, it''s a powerful shot.  9</td>', 'these images are amazing.  the detail is great, the ''work'' is at the same time obvious but subtle.  i have to say though, that the merging of the three images rather than framing each one reduces the effectiveness of the final photo a bit (or maybe if they hadn''t been merged so well and some seperation between each photo was more obvious).  regardless, it''s a powerful shot.  9', '2003-05-02 02:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(285657, 19628, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting and engaging shot, even for folks who don''t "go" for cars. I like the focus, colors and glitz of these autos. They celebrate headlights!</td>', 'Interesting and engaging shot, even for folks who don''t "go" for cars. I like the focus, colors and glitz of these autos. They celebrate headlights!', '2003-05-02 02:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(285659, 19725, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun stuff! I happen to be a huge fan of Wright, so I find this very engaging. I really can''t read the small text, though in poster form it would probably work, and I wish the point of view of these structures were such that the interesting and unique things about Wright''s architecture (the "essence" of Wright) were really displayed. They just look like houses here.</td>', 'Fun stuff! I happen to be a huge fan of Wright, so I find this very engaging. I really can''t read the small text, though in poster form it would probably work, and I wish the point of view of these structures were such that the interesting and unique things about Wright''s architecture (the "essence" of Wright) were really displayed. They just look like houses here.', '2003-05-02 02:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(285660, 19358, 6870, '<td valign="top">Unique and intriguing. The "frames" seem to bring a bizarrely postmodern feeling to this image, as if the relationship were being scientifically dissected, which is strange, because postmodernism is usually so cold. However, the image and subject matter itself defy this, so it''s as if you are gently poking fun at how such relationships are dissected. I''m in Lala Land now, so I''ll stop. IN essence, this is a complex image that is warm and gentle, but goes much farther. Congratulations!</td>', 'Unique and intriguing. The "frames" seem to bring a bizarrely postmodern feeling to this image, as if the relationship were being scientifically dissected, which is strange, because postmodernism is usually so cold. However, the image and subject matter itself defy this, so it''s as if you are gently poking fun at how such relationships are dissected. I''m in Lala Land now, so I''ll stop. IN essence, this is a complex image that is warm and gentle, but goes much farther. Congratulations!', '2003-05-02 02:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(285734, 19722, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice images but I don''t like the way that the top right image cuts into the lower image. <br/>That red spot the yellow fly is stepping into also isn''t appealing.<br/>Lastly, wondering what the pinky beigy background is on the right side of the lower image?<br/>Definitely an interesting collection, but layout not strong for me.</td>', 'Nice images but I don''t like the way that the top right image cuts into the lower image. That red spot the yellow fly is stepping into also isn''t appealing.Lastly, wondering what the pinky beigy background is on the right side of the lower image?Definitely an interesting collection, but layout not strong for me.', '2003-05-02 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(285735, 19652, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good job Carsten or Mrs. Carsten.  I like the way you took this.   Black and white was a good choice for this serious type of mood.</td>', 'Good job Carsten or Mrs. Carsten.  I like the way you took this.   Black and white was a good choice for this serious type of mood.', '2003-05-02 06:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(285736, 19221, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely collection of images and nicely taken - layout of collection doesn''t work well for me - too symmetrical I think.</td>', 'Lovely collection of images and nicely taken - layout of collection doesn''t work well for me - too symmetrical I think.', '2003-05-02 06:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(285737, 19415, 3540, '<td valign="top">The middle image kind of throws off the continuity of this.  I think its a good image, but just not for the other 2.</td>', 'The middle image kind of throws off the continuity of this.  I think its a good image, but just not for the other 2.', '2003-05-02 06:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(285738, 19747, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good display of motion.  I think they''re all just a touch underexposed, but its one of the better displays of triptych in the challenge.</td>', 'Good display of motion.  I think they''re all just a touch underexposed, but its one of the better displays of triptych in the challenge.', '2003-05-02 06:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(285740, 19557, 3540, '<td valign="top">The order seems a little backward on this one.  My kids have this Mr. Potatohead kit and about 4 other ones too.  Adorable little girl.  I wish the background wasn''t quite so busy.</td>', 'The order seems a little backward on this one.  My kids have this Mr. Potatohead kit and about 4 other ones too.  Adorable little girl.  I wish the background wasn''t quite so busy.', '2003-05-02 06:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(285741, 19695, 3540, '<td valign="top">Is this the jedi mind trick?  Good idea "hooded" one.</td>', 'Is this the jedi mind trick?  Good idea "hooded" one.', '2003-05-02 07:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(285742, 19719, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I like the color changes.  Too bad the last frame couldn''t have been just a little more vertical to match the other 2.  Nice pic and it meets the challenge</td>', 'Good idea.  I like the color changes.  Too bad the last frame couldn''t have been just a little more vertical to match the other 2.  Nice pic and it meets the challenge', '2003-05-02 07:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(285743, 19553, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting.  I didn''t really know that light would show thru tulips like this.   Good DOF and perspective too.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting.  I didn''t really know that light would show thru tulips like this.   Good DOF and perspective too.', '2003-05-02 07:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(285744, 19757, 3540, '<td valign="top">The middle panel looks like its just a smidge lower than the other 2.  Good idea and almost flawlessly executed.  The varying weather conditions are a good idea on this photo.</td>', 'The middle panel looks like its just a smidge lower than the other 2.  Good idea and almost flawlessly executed.  The varying weather conditions are a good idea on this photo.', '2003-05-02 07:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(285745, 19579, 3540, '<td valign="top">As many interesting ideas as there are in this challenge, I think so far this is the most creative and well executed pic in the challenge.  It looks like a substantial amount of work went into this as well.  Nice job - 10</td>', 'As many interesting ideas as there are in this challenge, I think so far this is the most creative and well executed pic in the challenge.  It looks like a substantial amount of work went into this as well.  Nice job - 10', '2003-05-02 07:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(285746, 19331, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a good take on this challenge.  I''m not sure I like the 3rd one in color, but I really like the first 2.  The first one looks like its at a slightly more dramatic angle than the 2nd.  Other than that its got good continuity.</td>', 'This is a good take on this challenge.  I''m not sure I like the 3rd one in color, but I really like the first 2.  The first one looks like its at a slightly more dramatic angle than the 2nd.  Other than that its got good continuity.', '2003-05-02 07:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(285748, 19276, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good story here.  I think a lot of these pics sort of missed the boat on that one.  I don''t really care for the heavy green border though.</td>', 'Good story here.  I think a lot of these pics sort of missed the boat on that one.  I don''t really care for the heavy green border though.', '2003-05-02 07:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(285749, 19258, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is an odd order to portray these pics.  I would think that either going widest to closest or closest to widest would be optimum.  The images in the middle is quite a bit off the vertical.</td>', 'This is an odd order to portray these pics.  I would think that either going widest to closest or closest to widest would be optimum.  The images in the middle is quite a bit off the vertical.', '2003-05-02 07:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(285755, 19769, 3540, '<td valign="top">The proportions of this photo don''t seem to match really well.  It may be the way the shadows are, but it just seems odd.  The head seems more than a little bit small.   Conceptually its a pretty good idea.</td>', 'The proportions of this photo don''t seem to match really well.  It may be the way the shadows are, but it just seems odd.  The head seems more than a little bit small.   Conceptually its a pretty good idea.', '2003-05-02 07:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(285757, 19763, 3540, '<td valign="top">The motion could be a little more frozen.  I think this is cute, but what would''ve made it really special was to have each frame seem like it was still.  The portrayal of motion should be shown by three still frames.  Its one of the better uses of realy triptych in the challenge, but the motion shown in each frame is a little too much.  But its adorable anyway!</td>', 'The motion could be a little more frozen.  I think this is cute, but what would''ve made it really special was to have each frame seem like it was still.  The portrayal of motion should be shown by three still frames.  Its one of the better uses of realy triptych in the challenge, but the motion shown in each frame is a little too much.  But its adorable anyway!', '2003-05-02 07:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(285820, 19755, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting presentation... quality of the image looks a bit pixellated or dithered.. but I like the movement in the entire image</td>', 'interesting presentation... quality of the image looks a bit pixellated or dithered.. but I like the movement in the entire image', '2003-05-02 09:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(285822, 19752, 806, '<td valign="top">a unique display. I think most people would have shown the peacock''s crest in a close up, but I like how you have turned him around! :0)<br/>sorta "now you see me, now you don''t".. nice framing, composition, lines and patterns in the feathers. good for you.</td>', 'a unique display. I think most people would have shown the peacock''s crest in a close up, but I like how you have turned him around! :0)sorta "now you see me, now you don''t".. nice framing, composition, lines and patterns in the feathers. good for you.', '2003-05-02 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(285824, 19719, 806, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you have started with here.. I may have continued it by overlapping the images a bit more to make it look continuous, but it would still be separated by a thin border around each frame and by the different color tones. the interruption in the cars doesn''t bother me as much as the left over palms in the tree in the central frame. Try a slight more overlap. I''d be curious to see it.</td>', 'I like the idea you have started with here.. I may have continued it by overlapping the images a bit more to make it look continuous, but it would still be separated by a thin border around each frame and by the different color tones. the interruption in the cars doesn''t bother me as much as the left over palms in the tree in the central frame. Try a slight more overlap. I''d be curious to see it.', '2003-05-02 09:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(285826, 19662, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting to view. nice scene. a bit dithered in the colors.. maybe the exposure was a bit dark to start with.</td>', 'interesting to view. nice scene. a bit dithered in the colors.. maybe the exposure was a bit dark to start with.', '2003-05-02 09:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(285829, 19561, 806, '<td valign="top">how very "Warhol" of you! :0)<br/></td>', 'how very "Warhol" of you! :0)', '2003-05-02 09:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(285830, 19415, 806, '<td valign="top">this is very relaxing to view. nice work.</td>', 'this is very relaxing to view. nice work.', '2003-05-02 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(285839, 19407, 3724, '<td valign="top">The proportional frame is good, though it could be a little heavy and dark.  Subject of harp player and especially the instrument is interesting.  The image is balanced and formal... and thoughtfully composed.</td>', 'The proportional frame is good, though it could be a little heavy and dark.  Subject of harp player and especially the instrument is interesting.  The image is balanced and formal... and thoughtfully composed.', '2003-05-02 10:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
