(286399, 19358, 8363, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. The sensitivity of the subject is beautifully reflected in the sensitivity of the photographer composing this. Well done!</td>', 'Gorgeous. The sensitivity of the subject is beautifully reflected in the sensitivity of the photographer composing this. Well done!', '2003-05-03 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(286464, 19415, 3585, '<td valign="top">nice series and atmosphere, since there is already a sense of symetry given by the images, i would not have centered the caption. White lines around each image are probably not neccessary. Try to create your lines when the image has been changed to the size you will submit it, you will get a much cleaner result. 7</td>', 'nice series and atmosphere, since there is already a sense of symetry given by the images, i would not have centered the caption. White lines around each image are probably not neccessary. Try to create your lines when the image has been changed to the size you will submit it, you will get a much cleaner result. 7', '2003-05-03 08:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(286467, 19764, 3585, '<td valign="top">good idea to propose different angles as well. I tried dark frames on this one, It gives a much more blending effect to the whole image. 8</td>', 'good idea to propose different angles as well. I tried dark frames on this one, It gives a much more blending effect to the whole image. 8', '2003-05-03 08:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(286502, 19712, 8282, '<td valign="top">Brilliant..totally!!!  I love this idea, and the way you nailed it!!  Good job ;)</td>', 'Brilliant..totally!!!  I love this idea, and the way you nailed it!!  Good job ;)', '2003-05-03 10:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(286553, 19716, 8401, '<td valign="top">A clean, unostentatious re-presentation of shapes, presenting a fresh consideration through simple juxtaposition, gentle use of sepia tone that lends itself to the urban.</td>', 'A clean, unostentatious re-presentation of shapes, presenting a fresh consideration through simple juxtaposition, gentle use of sepia tone that lends itself to the urban.', '2003-05-03 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(286558, 19766, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea.  Overall a bit dark.  I like the reflection on the first one, but would like to see it on the rest too<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice Idea.  Overall a bit dark.  I like the reflection on the first one, but would like to see it on the rest too ', '2003-05-03 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(286559, 19250, 6771, '<td valign="top">I love the composition you set up.  Of course I would like to see it much larger, but what can ya do.  Looks like a portfolio set up on a table.  Very nice.</td>', 'I love the composition you set up.  Of course I would like to see it much larger, but what can ya do.  Looks like a portfolio set up on a table.  Very nice.', '2003-05-03 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(286560, 19234, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Overall seems to be hazy in appearance, and the colors seem dull and muted.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Overall seems to be hazy in appearance, and the colors seem dull and muted.', '2003-05-03 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(286561, 19769, 6771, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I think this coud have even more impact if the body parts were stretched out farther from the  torso.  Great lighting and focus</td>', 'Cool idea.  I think this coud have even more impact if the body parts were stretched out farther from the  torso.  Great lighting and focus', '2003-05-03 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(286562, 19752, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Hard to see the focus with it being small because of the constraints, but looks ok.  Some symmetry working throughout.  I would like to have seen the pictures (front and back) taken at about the same or opposing angles, that may have balanced out the composition a bit more</td>', 'Great colors.  Hard to see the focus with it being small because of the constraints, but looks ok.  Some symmetry working throughout.  I would like to have seen the pictures (front and back) taken at about the same or opposing angles, that may have balanced out the composition a bit more', '2003-05-03 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(286563, 19652, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great one for the family''s wall.  I am more of the type who likes a bit more (contrasting) light on B&amp;W.  The same light casting of light on both of the twins faces in the middle pic would balance this out just a bit more.  Nice focus.</td>', 'Great one for the family''s wall.  I am more of the type who likes a bit more (contrasting) light on B&W.  The same light casting of light on both of the twins faces in the middle pic would balance this out just a bit more.  Nice focus.', '2003-05-03 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(286612, 19576, 8417, '<td valign="top">Beautiful greys...I love the blend, too.</td>', 'Beautiful greys...I love the blend, too.', '2003-05-03 16:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(286613, 19177, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, and the layout!  My husband was looking at this picture, and he thought it was kinda "sexy".  One nitpicky comment:  I wish the little bolts in the picture to the right weren''t "cut off".</td>', 'Love the concept, and the layout!  My husband was looking at this picture, and he thought it was kinda "sexy".  One nitpicky comment:  I wish the little bolts in the picture to the right weren''t "cut off".', '2003-05-03 16:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(286628, 19690, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s an interesting image.  The top and bottom shots frame the middle shot pretty well.  The effect here is effectively applied, and applicable to the shot, as it is intended to display motion.  So I''d say this is more than just photoshop for the sake of photoshop, however, I wouldn''t really say this is a photograph so much as a piece of art that used a photograph as it''s basis, so I''m not as inclined to score it as highly in a photography contest.  Good luck. 5</td>', 'Well, it''s an interesting image.  The top and bottom shots frame the middle shot pretty well.  The effect here is effectively applied, and applicable to the shot, as it is intended to display motion.  So I''d say this is more than just photoshop for the sake of photoshop, however, I wouldn''t really say this is a photograph so much as a piece of art that used a photograph as it''s basis, so I''m not as inclined to score it as highly in a photography contest.  Good luck. 5', '2003-05-03 18:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(286630, 19557, 4007, '<td valign="top">I suppose these shots are intended to have a candid feel to them, but the result isn''t very visually appealing.  The cluttered background and pretty much expressionless child detract from the shot.  The Mr.Potato Head concept was a good idea, and if you had simplified the shot and done close up shots of different stages of potato head construction I think the result would have been very interesting.</td>', 'I suppose these shots are intended to have a candid feel to them, but the result isn''t very visually appealing.  The cluttered background and pretty much expressionless child detract from the shot.  The Mr.Potato Head concept was a good idea, and if you had simplified the shot and done close up shots of different stages of potato head construction I think the result would have been very interesting.', '2003-05-03 18:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(286632, 19069, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like the center frame and how it shows up in minimalist ways only, however, it doesn''t really fit into the tone of this sequence very well, since the other two show up very clearly and strongly.  I think putting the center shot against a white background would have created an interesting contrast with the other two shots, but still maintained the same tone as the other shots. 7</td>', 'I really like the center frame and how it shows up in minimalist ways only, however, it doesn''t really fit into the tone of this sequence very well, since the other two show up very clearly and strongly.  I think putting the center shot against a white background would have created an interesting contrast with the other two shots, but still maintained the same tone as the other shots. 7', '2003-05-03 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(286634, 19619, 4007, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting.. but it has an overprocessed look to it.</td>', 'Interesting lighting.. but it has an overprocessed look to it.', '2003-05-03 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(286635, 19722, 4007, '<td valign="top">The top images would look better if they were the same height.  It kills the balance and symmetry by making the right side jut out into the bottom shot.</td>', 'The top images would look better if they were the same height.  It kills the balance and symmetry by making the right side jut out into the bottom shot.', '2003-05-03 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(286636, 19278, 4007, '<td valign="top">Heh.. how did a toyota celica get in there with two porsches?</td>', 'Heh.. how did a toyota celica get in there with two porsches?', '2003-05-03 18:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(286640, 19264, 8401, '<td valign="top">Truly dreadful. Enough said.</td>', 'Truly dreadful. Enough said.', '2003-05-03 18:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(286641, 19234, 8401, '<td valign="top">Compelling.</td>', 'Compelling.', '2003-05-03 18:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(286642, 19742, 4007, '<td valign="top">The first shot seems like an awkward fit for the sequence, since the other two shots have the same perspective but the first is different (without any particular reason for being different).  Also each of these shots are really too small to be effective.. with such limited space in the first place, you might have been better off using a much smaller boarder.</td>', 'The first shot seems like an awkward fit for the sequence, since the other two shots have the same perspective but the first is different (without any particular reason for being different).  Also each of these shots are really too small to be effective.. with such limited space in the first place, you might have been better off using a much smaller boarder.', '2003-05-03 19:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(286643, 19712, 4007, '<td valign="top">This really strikes me as a single frame shot that was forced into a multi-frame format.  I don''t really see much purpose in dividing it up.  I do like the sort of hazy oversaturated effect you have created here.  It gives it a dreamlike feel. 6</td>', 'This really strikes me as a single frame shot that was forced into a multi-frame format.  I don''t really see much purpose in dividing it up.  I do like the sort of hazy oversaturated effect you have created here.  It gives it a dreamlike feel. 6', '2003-05-03 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(286645, 19493, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the first frame, but I think the other two are less effective.  I think this concept would be better illustrated if the final frame were a normal looking portrait, as this one still ends up looking unfinished.</td>', 'I like the first frame, but I think the other two are less effective.  I think this concept would be better illustrated if the final frame were a normal looking portrait, as this one still ends up looking unfinished.', '2003-05-03 19:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(286646, 19234, 4007, '<td valign="top">The colors here look washed out and the eye isn''t in sharp focus.  The concept has some potential, but the presentation lacks oomph.  I''d have tried different angles and probably more dramatic lighting, as this ends up rather drab.</td>', 'The colors here look washed out and the eye isn''t in sharp focus.  The concept has some potential, but the presentation lacks oomph.  I''d have tried different angles and probably more dramatic lighting, as this ends up rather drab.', '2003-05-03 19:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286674, 19059, 5212, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  If I would change one thing, it might be to lighten up the middle picture.  The emotoinal connection illustrated here is wonderful.  9</td>', 'This is really nice.  If I would change one thing, it might be to lighten up the middle picture.  The emotoinal connection illustrated here is wonderful.  9', '2003-05-03 21:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(286676, 19765, 5212, '<td valign="top">It''s a ten from me.</td>', 'It''s a ten from me.', '2003-05-03 21:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(286678, 19280, 5212, '<td valign="top">The eyes are a little light on the lower left image, but after having taken dozens of photos of my own cats, I know how hard it is to get a decent photo without flash.  I don''t understand the light/dark areas in the upper background, though.</td>', 'The eyes are a little light on the lower left image, but after having taken dozens of photos of my own cats, I know how hard it is to get a decent photo without flash.  I don''t understand the light/dark areas in the upper background, though.', '2003-05-03 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(286680, 19736, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very creative shots.  8</td>', 'Very creative shots.  8', '2003-05-03 21:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286681, 19264, 5212, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of those button looking borders and the non solid background.  Just one opinion, though.</td>', 'I am not fond of those button looking borders and the non solid background.  Just one opinion, though.', '2003-05-03 21:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(286683, 19628, 5212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, great color and clarity of image.  The theme is very consitent as well as the bright lighting that enhances the shiney surfaces.  10</td>', 'I like the composition here, great color and clarity of image.  The theme is very consitent as well as the bright lighting that enhances the shiney surfaces.  10', '2003-05-03 21:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(286686, 19625, 5212, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better if you had three differing views of the trumpet, and they were a little less exposed, or you used softer lighting.</td>', 'I think this might have worked better if you had three differing views of the trumpet, and they were a little less exposed, or you used softer lighting.', '2003-05-03 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(286698, 19358, 5044, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is exactly what a triptych is, but this is an AWESOME picture! Being a father of 3, I know this feeling and love the image you are portraying. It is very well done, very soft and loving. Excellent shot and my pick for the winner. Good luck! 10</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is exactly what a triptych is, but this is an AWESOME picture! Being a father of 3, I know this feeling and love the image you are portraying. It is very well done, very soft and loving. Excellent shot and my pick for the winner. Good luck! 10', '2003-05-03 22:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(286715, 19429, 5212, '<td valign="top">An atypical composition for this challenge.  I commend you for thinking outside the box.  well done.</td>', 'An atypical composition for this challenge.  I commend you for thinking outside the box.  well done.', '2003-05-03 22:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(286759, 19757, 6019, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if one pic had been chopped rather than 3 sep. I''d have spread them apart a bit more for a stunning statement!</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if one pic had been chopped rather than 3 sep. I''d have spread them apart a bit more for a stunning statement!', '2003-05-03 23:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(286762, 19355, 6019, '<td valign="top">great idea, its not clear however what the pic on the right is about...</td>', 'great idea, its not clear however what the pic on the right is about...', '2003-05-03 23:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(286763, 19750, 6019, '<td valign="top">the writing on the side is distracting from anotherwise great composition</td>', 'the writing on the side is distracting from anotherwise great composition', '2003-05-03 23:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(286780, 19652, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just love your images, and the overall look of the triptych.  I like the lighting that you chose, and really love the black and white, as well as the font that you chose to put on it.  Overall very nice, definitely one of my top picks.</td>', 'I just love your images, and the overall look of the triptych.  I like the lighting that you chose, and really love the black and white, as well as the font that you chose to put on it.  Overall very nice, definitely one of my top picks.', '2003-05-04 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(286781, 19221, 2553, '<td valign="top">I adore the photos in this triptych.  The choice of black and white works very nicely, and I especially like your "theme".  I am not totally crazy about the font that you chose, I think it detracts just slightly from the overall image by constantly drawing your eye away from the photos.  I think that I would have preferred not to see any text at all, however, that does not keep this from being one of my top picks.</td>', 'I adore the photos in this triptych.  The choice of black and white works very nicely, and I especially like your "theme".  I am not totally crazy about the font that you chose, I think it detracts just slightly from the overall image by constantly drawing your eye away from the photos.  I think that I would have preferred not to see any text at all, however, that does not keep this from being one of my top picks.', '2003-05-04 00:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(286783, 19550, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photos, and in this case I am glad that you did not try to go black and white.  The color is so much more powerful.  I like the misty look, and I like the overall effect of the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful photos, and in this case I am glad that you did not try to go black and white.  The color is so much more powerful.  I like the misty look, and I like the overall effect of the lighting.', '2003-05-04 00:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(286785, 19360, 2553, '<td valign="top">Adorable shots!  Love the black and white, of course.  I like the lighting of your shots, but the reflection in her eyes is distracting to me - there seems to be just TOO much reflection for some reason.  I love the "shadowing" that you put behind the photos, and I also like your choice of font.</td>', 'Adorable shots!  Love the black and white, of course.  I like the lighting of your shots, but the reflection in her eyes is distracting to me - there seems to be just TOO much reflection for some reason.  I love the "shadowing" that you put behind the photos, and I also like your choice of font.', '2003-05-04 00:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(286786, 19690, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is just the coolest triptych!   I can imagine that a lot of peeps will say that you "over-photoshopped" it, but I love it!   The effects are great, and the overall look  is nicely cohesive.  I love the border effect as well.  I admit that the large center photo kind of throws me because I can''t figure out all the effects, but hey, it''s still one of my top picks.</td>', 'This is just the coolest triptych!   I can imagine that a lot of peeps will say that you "over-photoshopped" it, but I love it!   The effects are great, and the overall look  is nicely cohesive.  I love the border effect as well.  I admit that the large center photo kind of throws me because I can''t figure out all the effects, but hey, it''s still one of my top picks.', '2003-05-04 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(286788, 19026, 2553, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Great color, lighting, and cropping.  Love your "theme", and you pulled your photos together very well to make a cohesive and engaging triptych.    One of my favs!</td>', 'Whoa!  Great color, lighting, and cropping.  Love your "theme", and you pulled your photos together very well to make a cohesive and engaging triptych.    One of my favs!', '2003-05-04 00:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(286792, 19712, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  I love the lighting, the color, and the effects.  This is a beautiful triptych that is very visually appealing, and just continually engages the eyes.  I find my eyes moving all the way through the shots and then back again.  I would hang this on my wall in a minute!  One of my favs.</td>', 'Nicely done!  I love the lighting, the color, and the effects.  This is a beautiful triptych that is very visually appealing, and just continually engages the eyes.  I find my eyes moving all the way through the shots and then back again.  I would hang this on my wall in a minute!  One of my favs.', '2003-05-04 00:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(286793, 19584, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely one of my favorites.  I love the choice of sepia, and that the baby is shown with each of the family members.  The photos are beautifully soft, and the lighting is done well.  I hope that you are so proud of this triptych, it is truly beautiful.</td>', 'Absolutely one of my favorites.  I love the choice of sepia, and that the baby is shown with each of the family members.  The photos are beautifully soft, and the lighting is done well.  I hope that you are so proud of this triptych, it is truly beautiful.', '2003-05-04 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(286796, 19221, 3018, '<td valign="top">The pictures are great! B&amp;W looks perfect, and your composition with the three images is very nice.  I don''t quite like the bar with the title in the middle.  I think it would look better without the bar, and give a little more space to the right and left pictures.  Good luck!</td>', 'The pictures are great! B&W looks perfect, and your composition with the three images is very nice.  I don''t quite like the bar with the title in the middle.  I think it would look better without the bar, and give a little more space to the right and left pictures.  Good luck!', '2003-05-04 00:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(286798, 19643, 3018, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little documentary.  Nice pictures!  Good luck!</td>', 'Looks like a little documentary.  Nice pictures!  Good luck!', '2003-05-04 00:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(286818, 19587, 7778, '<td valign="top">Enduring interest...<br/> <br/>Nothing distracting in it either... An oasis after viewing most images in this challenge. I bow.</td>', 'Enduring interest... Nothing distracting in it either... An oasis after viewing most images in this challenge. I bow.', '2003-05-04 01:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(286825, 19583, 1877, '<td valign="top">great ad ;)</td>', 'great ad ;)', '2003-05-04 01:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(286831, 19493, 7778, '<td valign="top">ah...<br/> <br/>this is ''transporting''!<br/> <br/>                                                                                              [beauty is so rare a thing]</td>', 'ah... this is ''transporting''!                                                                                               [beauty is so rare a thing]', '2003-05-04 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(286904, 19619, 7350, '<td valign="top">Over pixelated.</td>', 'Over pixelated.', '2003-05-04 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(286906, 19716, 8430, '<td valign="top">Nice but spoiled by the text.</td>', 'Nice but spoiled by the text.', '2003-05-04 03:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(286912, 19716, 4007, '<td valign="top">The top left image looks over cropped (blurry, low resolution).  The top left, and bottom images are somewhat interesting, although not particularly drawing.  However, the top right image is excelent.  The curves and lines work quite effectively in it, and I think it would be better as a stand alone image than this is as a multi-image.</td>', 'The top left image looks over cropped (blurry, low resolution).  The top left, and bottom images are somewhat interesting, although not particularly drawing.  However, the top right image is excelent.  The curves and lines work quite effectively in it, and I think it would be better as a stand alone image than this is as a multi-image.', '2003-05-04 04:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(286913, 19546, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Perfect in b&amp;w. The left picture is not as good as the other ones, but overall a triptych I like very much.</td>', 'Great idea. Perfect in b&w. The left picture is not as good as the other ones, but overall a triptych I like very much.', '2003-05-04 04:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(286914, 19764, 4007, '<td valign="top">the top and bottom images strike me as so-so, but that center image is really excelent.  Great angle for the panoramic shot you got.</td>', 'the top and bottom images strike me as so-so, but that center image is really excelent.  Great angle for the panoramic shot you got.', '2003-05-04 04:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286915, 19628, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crops on these.  I think the result is more compelling than if they had been more revealing shots of the cars.  Lets see how my identification skills are, I''d guess top to bottom: Lamborghini (Diablo), Jag (not sure about that one), and Ferrari (F50).  I guess I''ll see how I did after the challenge. 8</td>', 'I like the tight crops on these.  I think the result is more compelling than if they had been more revealing shots of the cars.  Lets see how my identification skills are, I''d guess top to bottom: Lamborghini (Diablo), Jag (not sure about that one), and Ferrari (F50).  I guess I''ll see how I did after the challenge. 8', '2003-05-04 04:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(286916, 19407, 4007, '<td valign="top">This was a good choice for a multi-image shot, because the right and left side shots are good shots, but without a context they would be hard to identify for someone not familar with the harp.  However, the middle shot provides that context, and therefore makes the other shots more effective.  Good work. 7</td>', 'This was a good choice for a multi-image shot, because the right and left side shots are good shots, but without a context they would be hard to identify for someone not familar with the harp.  However, the middle shot provides that context, and therefore makes the other shots more effective.  Good work. 7', '2003-05-04 04:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(286917, 19613, 4007, '<td valign="top">The people (and staircases) provide a sense of scale that makes this shot immensely more effective.  This shot made me think about how I can''t even imagine a living one of those suckers.</td>', 'The people (and staircases) provide a sense of scale that makes this shot immensely more effective.  This shot made me think about how I can''t even imagine a living one of those suckers.', '2003-05-04 04:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(286918, 19584, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Perfect in sepia. Why the cap in the right picture? It leaves a white space in the left corner that is a little disturbing. I think you did right to take a little more pxels between the pictures, because every picture can stand on its own and need more space. Perhaps I had chosen a white background in left picture as in the other two. Overall a triptych I like very much. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Great idea. Perfect in sepia. Why the cap in the right picture? It leaves a white space in the left corner that is a little disturbing. I think you did right to take a little more pxels between the pictures, because every picture can stand on its own and need more space. Perhaps I had chosen a white background in left picture as in the other two. Overall a triptych I like very much. Well done and good luck!', '2003-05-04 04:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(286919, 19415, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Perfect in b&amp;w. Perhaps I had chosen to mirror left picture to make it "look" into the center. Overall a triptych I like very much. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Great idea. Perfect in b&w. Perhaps I had chosen to mirror left picture to make it "look" into the center. Overall a triptych I like very much. Well done and good luck!', '2003-05-04 04:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
