(287262, 19587, 6202, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this in color, if I''m not mistaken someone had a messy fun time, and this is the leftovers from it.  The center photo could have been a little better on the focus near the left side of the "syrup" along the side of the tub the focus gets blurry to soon in my opinion, but I love the photos anyhow, can''t help but give you an 8 just cause it makes me smile.</td>', 'I would love to see this in color, if I''m not mistaken someone had a messy fun time, and this is the leftovers from it.  The center photo could have been a little better on the focus near the left side of the "syrup" along the side of the tub the focus gets blurry to soon in my opinion, but I love the photos anyhow, can''t help but give you an 8 just cause it makes me smile.', '2003-05-04 21:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(287264, 19091, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very well done, the focus is really sharp and all three images make the same statement.</td>', 'Very well done, the focus is really sharp and all three images make the same statement.', '2003-05-04 21:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(287266, 19636, 6202, '<td valign="top">3 very good macros, nicely put together, was wondering if you also tried with a bit of a border between each photo or not.  Would love to see this composition also with a little space between each photo.  But even as it is it is really cool.</td>', '3 very good macros, nicely put together, was wondering if you also tried with a bit of a border between each photo or not.  Would love to see this composition also with a little space between each photo.  But even as it is it is really cool.', '2003-05-04 21:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(287267, 19232, 806, '<td valign="top">the detail in the eye is amazing!</td>', 'the detail in the eye is amazing!', '2003-05-04 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(287271, 19280, 6202, '<td valign="top">3 beautiful cat photos, nicely put together also.</td>', '3 beautiful cat photos, nicely put together also.', '2003-05-04 21:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(287294, 19739, 4007, '<td valign="top">A single frame of one of these shots would work out pretty well, but together it just becomes redundant, and nothing seems to be gained by the repetition, since they each have a different background, but they all still look pretty much the same.</td>', 'A single frame of one of these shots would work out pretty well, but together it just becomes redundant, and nothing seems to be gained by the repetition, since they each have a different background, but they all still look pretty much the same.', '2003-05-04 21:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(287296, 19678, 4007, '<td valign="top">The boarder just strikes me as cheesy.</td>', 'The boarder just strikes me as cheesy.', '2003-05-04 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(287302, 19759, 4007, '<td valign="top">In your main shot here, it looks like your focus might be locked onto the eyelashes or the area around the eye, instead of the eye itself, which isn''t in sharp focus.  Having messed around with many eye shots myself (and having submitted an eye series to this challenge) I know this is hard to avoid, but mostly you just have to experiment a lot to see what works.</td>', 'In your main shot here, it looks like your focus might be locked onto the eyelashes or the area around the eye, instead of the eye itself, which isn''t in sharp focus.  Having messed around with many eye shots myself (and having submitted an eye series to this challenge) I know this is hard to avoid, but mostly you just have to experiment a lot to see what works.', '2003-05-04 21:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(287303, 19166, 4007, '<td valign="top">The yellow boarder is a bit overpowering.  Something more mild would be better, or maybe just plain black for contrast.</td>', 'The yellow boarder is a bit overpowering.  Something more mild would be better, or maybe just plain black for contrast.', '2003-05-04 21:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(287304, 19177, 4007, '<td valign="top">Funny concept.  But for this simple (and not inately interesting) of a subject, these macros need to be in sharper focus, and I would personally prefer more dramatic lighting or more contrast between subject and background. 5</td>', 'Funny concept.  But for this simple (and not inately interesting) of a subject, these macros need to be in sharper focus, and I would personally prefer more dramatic lighting or more contrast between subject and background. 5', '2003-05-04 21:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(287305, 19717, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the streak of color on the right side of the top frame.  Other than that, I like this composition quite a bit.</td>', 'I don''t understand the streak of color on the right side of the top frame.  Other than that, I like this composition quite a bit.', '2003-05-04 22:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(287308, 19091, 4007, '<td valign="top">These are all strong crisp shots that flow together wonderfully in this composition.  Great work. 10</td>', 'These are all strong crisp shots that flow together wonderfully in this composition.  Great work. 10', '2003-05-04 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(287309, 19415, 4007, '<td valign="top">These shots do an incredible job of creating the feeling of stillness and wonder.  Incredible work. 10</td>', 'These shots do an incredible job of creating the feeling of stillness and wonder.  Incredible work. 10', '2003-05-04 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(287310, 19355, 4007, '<td valign="top">This is excelent, with the green bud standing out just right.. but I cannot for the life of me figure out what is in the right frame.  Good work. 8</td>', 'This is excelent, with the green bud standing out just right.. but I cannot for the life of me figure out what is in the right frame.  Good work. 8', '2003-05-04 22:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(287331, 19221, 7901, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent and I really like how you captured each individual "fuzzy" (can''t think of the actual name). Almost looks like sparklers. Great job.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent and I really like how you captured each individual "fuzzy" (can''t think of the actual name). Almost looks like sparklers. Great job.', '2003-05-04 23:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(287332, 19716, 7901, '<td valign="top">This is a nice piece to look at because of the contrast in images, tone and angles. The steps on the left upper pic look a tiny bit soft, or it could just be me. Good job. 9</td>', 'This is a nice piece to look at because of the contrast in images, tone and angles. The steps on the left upper pic look a tiny bit soft, or it could just be me. Good job. 9', '2003-05-04 23:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(287333, 19561, 7901, '<td valign="top">Good focus and exposure, but I''m not entirely sure what it''s about. Maybe you were really hungry? :)</td>', 'Good focus and exposure, but I''m not entirely sure what it''s about. Maybe you were really hungry? :)', '2003-05-04 23:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(287335, 19331, 7901, '<td valign="top">I really like the direction of this group. Also how the slope of each picture leads into the other and the color gradually comes. The textures of the old anchor set it off.</td>', 'I really like the direction of this group. Also how the slope of each picture leads into the other and the color gradually comes. The textures of the old anchor set it off.', '2003-05-04 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(287337, 19407, 7901, '<td valign="top">Great job, the 2 outter photos almost give you the view and feeling of what it''s like to be her playing it.</td>', 'Great job, the 2 outter photos almost give you the view and feeling of what it''s like to be her playing it.', '2003-05-04 23:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(287342, 19415, 7901, '<td valign="top">Nice work on this. I like perspective in this, showing man against the vastness off mountains. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice work on this. I like perspective in this, showing man against the vastness off mountains. Good luck.', '2003-05-04 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(287345, 19763, 7901, '<td valign="top">Focus is a tad bit soft it seems. But I think the enthusiasm she\''s expressing definitely does it.</td>', 'Focus is a tad bit soft it seems. But I think the enthusiasm she\''s expressing definitely does it.', '2003-05-04 23:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(287349, 19750, 7901, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on capturing the essence of the environment. The reflections are great and set it off.</td>', 'Very nice job on capturing the essence of the environment. The reflections are great and set it off.', '2003-05-04 23:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(287352, 19084, 7901, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s a pen and a glass of apple juice in her hands. ;)</td>', 'I hope that''s a pen and a glass of apple juice in her hands. ;)', '2003-05-04 23:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(287359, 19751, 7901, '<td valign="top">Each shot individually I like. But combined like that almost seems a little distracting.</td>', 'Each shot individually I like. But combined like that almost seems a little distracting.', '2003-05-04 23:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(287362, 19250, 7901, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea. I like how the images are combined. Even at a different perspectives you still can connect it.</td>', 'Really neat idea. I like how the images are combined. Even at a different perspectives you still can connect it.', '2003-05-04 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(287363, 19757, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love how the three panels tell different versions of the same story. Nice work. And to actually see the mountain long enough to get a picture of it is noteworthy in itself!</td>', 'I love how the three panels tell different versions of the same story. Nice work. And to actually see the mountain long enough to get a picture of it is noteworthy in itself!', '2003-05-04 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(287366, 19662, 7901, '<td valign="top">Varying the middle image above the others for some reason does something good for this. I think it breaks it up, sorta adds a little impact to the image. Good luck.</td>', 'Varying the middle image above the others for some reason does something good for this. I think it breaks it up, sorta adds a little impact to the image. Good luck.', '2003-05-04 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(287367, 19579, 7901, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. The different rows break it up and make it interesting. Nice.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. The different rows break it up and make it interesting. Nice.', '2003-05-04 23:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(287369, 19546, 7901, '<td valign="top">I take it each window was a different exposure? It works nicely and the exposure is just right.</td>', 'I take it each window was a different exposure? It works nicely and the exposure is just right.', '2003-05-04 23:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(287370, 19757, 7901, '<td valign="top">Seeing the different sky and the landscape around at different times of the day or different day makes it more interesting. Nice work.</td>', 'Seeing the different sky and the landscape around at different times of the day or different day makes it more interesting. Nice work.', '2003-05-04 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(287373, 19731, 7901, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this really sets the mood. The contrast of the images is nice too.</td>', 'The lighting in this really sets the mood. The contrast of the images is nice too.', '2003-05-04 23:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(287374, 19613, 7901, '<td valign="top">Good use of the challenge. I don''t think you could appreciate the size as much if it was crammed into one frame. The people standing next to it also work to show it''s size.</td>', 'Good use of the challenge. I don''t think you could appreciate the size as much if it was crammed into one frame. The people standing next to it also work to show it''s size.', '2003-05-04 23:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(287376, 19764, 7901, '<td valign="top">The exposure and focus in these photos are nice and clean, it''s hard to tell though if the top and bottom pics are each tower or the same.</td>', 'The exposure and focus in these photos are nice and clean, it''s hard to tell though if the top and bottom pics are each tower or the same.', '2003-05-04 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(287377, 19712, 7901, '<td valign="top">The colors definitely grab you on this. The focus seems a little soft, but from the looks of it, it looks intentional. Nice work.</td>', 'The colors definitely grab you on this. The focus seems a little soft, but from the looks of it, it looks intentional. Nice work.', '2003-05-04 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(287378, 19750, 714, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!!!  I just don''t like the text on its side.  vote 9</td>', 'I love this shot!!!  I just don''t like the text on its side.  vote 9', '2003-05-05 00:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(287381, 19221, 2989, '<td valign="top">This shots looks great in black and white and fits the challenge perfectly.  Each shot is great alone and together theses 3 shots are excellent!  Great job! 10</td>', 'This shots looks great in black and white and fits the challenge perfectly.  Each shot is great alone and together theses 3 shots are excellent!  Great job! 10', '2003-05-05 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(287382, 19765, 714, '<td valign="top">So far my favorite.  Lovely!!! vote 10</td>', 'So far my favorite.  Lovely!!! vote 10', '2003-05-05 00:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(287384, 19177, 3080, '<td valign="top">What a great story.  LOL.  This was pretty funny.  THe focus seems a bit soft on each photo though, more so in the very first photo on the way left.  Lighting is quite nice, no annoying glares, or bad shadows.  The angle is goos on the first 2, but I wish there were some way to not chop off the bolt heads in the far right photo.  Overall a nice job! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a great story.  LOL.  This was pretty funny.  THe focus seems a bit soft on each photo though, more so in the very first photo on the way left.  Lighting is quite nice, no annoying glares, or bad shadows.  The angle is goos on the first 2, but I wish there were some way to not chop off the bolt heads in the far right photo.  Overall a nice job! Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-05 00:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(287385, 19710, 714, '<td valign="top">ohhhh!!!!  What a great idea.  You are so creative!!  Vote 10</td>', 'ohhhh!!!!  What a great idea.  You are so creative!!  Vote 10', '2003-05-05 00:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(287386, 19280, 2989, '<td valign="top">I love cats and this is a great collection of cat pictures.  Each picture really is great on it''s own.  The background with the white and the dark outline takes away from this shot and the duotone of the cat pictures seems very weird to me.  All in all a fantastic shot of your cat! 10!</td>', 'I love cats and this is a great collection of cat pictures.  Each picture really is great on it''s own.  The background with the white and the dark outline takes away from this shot and the duotone of the cat pictures seems very weird to me.  All in all a fantastic shot of your cat! 10!', '2003-05-05 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(287387, 19767, 1847, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''m a sucker for a good beach scene, and I get three here!  Particularly, I like the middle and right photos, though if you look at my "fauna" entry, you''ll see that I can appreciate how hard it is to capture a gull!  Fantastic!</td>', 'Wow.  I''m a sucker for a good beach scene, and I get three here!  Particularly, I like the middle and right photos, though if you look at my "fauna" entry, you''ll see that I can appreciate how hard it is to capture a gull!  Fantastic!', '2003-05-05 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(287388, 19493, 3080, '<td valign="top">The thing that really bothers me in this trio is the fact that there is a part in her hair/head piece that looks like a deformed childs face.  I saw it as it was loading and was trying to figure out exactly what it was, and now I can''t take my eyes away from it to enjoy the rest of the photo.  Strange how something small things can just totally make or break a shot.  The model is pretty, and the angle on the model is nice, and it does tell a story, but that face bothers me. lol.  Sorry. ~Heather~</td>', 'The thing that really bothers me in this trio is the fact that there is a part in her hair/head piece that looks like a deformed childs face.  I saw it as it was loading and was trying to figure out exactly what it was, and now I can''t take my eyes away from it to enjoy the rest of the photo.  Strange how something small things can just totally make or break a shot.  The model is pretty, and the angle on the model is nice, and it does tell a story, but that face bothers me. lol.  Sorry. ~Heather~', '2003-05-05 00:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(287390, 19569, 1847, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this, and appreciate the effect you were going with by backlighting the main photo.  I just wish I could have seen a TINY bit more of the main shoot.  Very well done, though.</td>', 'I really, really like this, and appreciate the effect you were going with by backlighting the main photo.  I just wish I could have seen a TINY bit more of the main shoot.  Very well done, though.', '2003-05-05 00:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(287393, 19166, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do something similar for this challenge, but decided against it because I thought there would be a lot of them.  The idea is great.  I really like the way you took both flowers at the same angle.  The yellow border works nicely for this as well.  I think that the focus and clarity are good, and the lighting is also good.  my only suggestion would be to maybe been able to get them with the lighting the same on both flower, and bud, but don''t know how possible that would have been. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I wanted to do something similar for this challenge, but decided against it because I thought there would be a lot of them.  The idea is great.  I really like the way you took both flowers at the same angle.  The yellow border works nicely for this as well.  I think that the focus and clarity are good, and the lighting is also good.  my only suggestion would be to maybe been able to get them with the lighting the same on both flower, and bud, but don''t know how possible that would have been. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-05 00:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(287398, 19628, 3080, '<td valign="top">Somebody went to a car show last week. :)  Looks excelent.  Something I would hang on my wall.  Great job.  I like how you have 3 different colors of cars, the lighting is wonderful.  my only suggestion might have been to stagger the direction of the cars.  You have the top 2 at a NW angle, and the bottom one at a NE angle.  Maybe stagger them  so that the top is NW, the middle is NE and the bottom is NW.  if that makes sense.  Otherwise, great job! good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Somebody went to a car show last week. :)  Looks excelent.  Something I would hang on my wall.  Great job.  I like how you have 3 different colors of cars, the lighting is wonderful.  my only suggestion might have been to stagger the direction of the cars.  You have the top 2 at a NW angle, and the bottom one at a NE angle.  Maybe stagger them  so that the top is NW, the middle is NE and the bottom is NW.  if that makes sense.  Otherwise, great job! good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-05 00:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(287399, 19250, 1847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photos!</td>', 'Beautiful photos!', '2003-05-05 00:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(287400, 19605, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks delicious.  The one thing that bothers me though, is on the photo on the right, on the base of the glass, there is a hair.  that takes all the deliciousness away and makes me think gross.  Also, the strawberries look a bit oversaturated, and the leaves of the one on the glass are kind of brown and crusty.  While I think you have an excelent set up and combination of photos, it needs a bit of fine tuning and cleaning up.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks delicious.  The one thing that bothers me though, is on the photo on the right, on the base of the glass, there is a hair.  that takes all the deliciousness away and makes me think gross.  Also, the strawberries look a bit oversaturated, and the leaves of the one on the glass are kind of brown and crusty.  While I think you have an excelent set up and combination of photos, it needs a bit of fine tuning and cleaning up.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-05 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(287402, 19553, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this might have a higher visual impact on me had it been 2 seperate photos of the tulips.  This is one photo, flipped.  The photo is beautiful, excelent lighting and I love the black/green background on the tulips.  The border fits wonderfully.  Focus and clarity are good.  Looks better on the right than left however.  Overall nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this might have a higher visual impact on me had it been 2 seperate photos of the tulips.  This is one photo, flipped.  The photo is beautiful, excelent lighting and I love the black/green background on the tulips.  The border fits wonderfully.  Focus and clarity are good.  Looks better on the right than left however.  Overall nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-05 00:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
