(287425, 19716, 2667, '<td valign="top">outstanding image. If I had one nit to pick it would be that the first set of stairs was a bit grainy in relation to the rest of the image. Still a 10, though. Great work!</td>', 'outstanding image. If I had one nit to pick it would be that the first set of stairs was a bit grainy in relation to the rest of the image. Still a 10, though. Great work!', '2003-05-05 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
