(287429, 19026, 1847, '<td valign="top">I''m not a "metal and engines" guy, so I would have been surprised if one had told me that a motorcycle photo would grab my attention like this one has.  Really, really well done.  THe only small nit is the title.  Not so much the words (though I''m not a huge fan), but the font and placement.  Maybe a bit more subtle, to let the photography and motorcycle do the talking.</td>', 'I''m not a "metal and engines" guy, so I would have been surprised if one had told me that a motorcycle photo would grab my attention like this one has.  Really, really well done.  THe only small nit is the title.  Not so much the words (though I''m not a huge fan), but the font and placement.  Maybe a bit more subtle, to let the photography and motorcycle do the talking.', '2003-05-05 00:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(287430, 19617, 2389, '<td valign="top">This would be really effective if there were less "noise" in the blue... GOOD THEME.</td>', 'This would be really effective if there were less "noise" in the blue... GOOD THEME.', '2003-05-05 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
