(287481, 19546, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. Not as good as I had hoped. The trick to this shot is that it''s taken in 3 completely separate rooms. Just careful observation of layout and persepective. <br/> <br/>It was inspired by <a href="//www.masters-of-photography.com/D/decarava/decarava_stove_full.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> photo by DeCarava.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the great comments guys!</td>', 'Hmm.. Not as good as I had hoped. The trick to this shot is that it''s taken in 3 completely separate rooms. Just careful observation of layout and persepective.  It was inspired by this photo by DeCarava. Thanks for the great comments guys!', '2003-05-05 01:07:12.000000', NULL, 0),
