(287586, 19407, 2586, '<td valign="top">Marianne, had given you an 8 but had no time to comment. Like how this presentation give a good sense of what is must feel like to play the harp. The framing with the yellow harp details is rather bold, but it works and very effective in telling the ''story''. Good job!</td>', 'Marianne, had given you an 8 but had no time to comment. Like how this presentation give a good sense of what is must feel like to play the harp. The framing with the yellow harp details is rather bold, but it works and very effective in telling the ''story''. Good job!', '2003-05-05 02:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(287591, 19767, 2586, '<td valign="top">Karen, had given you an 8 but no time to comment. I pretty much guessed you did this. I really like the mood of this presentation - i can see/sense you spend a lot of time on the beach. Lovely colors, very tranquil. This image also reminded me of another one of yours, that i liked a lot, the one in Negative Space, Coming and Going?</td>', 'Karen, had given you an 8 but no time to comment. I pretty much guessed you did this. I really like the mood of this presentation - i can see/sense you spend a lot of time on the beach. Lovely colors, very tranquil. This image also reminded me of another one of yours, that i liked a lot, the one in Negative Space, Coming and Going?', '2003-05-05 02:06:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(287599, 19726, 2586, '<td valign="top">Would have thought this presentation would have done a lot better! That''s the black magic of dpc voters, i guess :)</td>', 'Would have thought this presentation would have done a lot better! That''s the black magic of dpc voters, i guess :)', '2003-05-05 02:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
