(287651, 19579, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanx for all the nice and helpful comments throughout this challenge. This was an idea I got after I found something similar while looking through a magazine. I changed a lot of stuff around which suited me better and adapted it to the challenge and ended up with this image.<br/> <br/>There really is quite a lot of work involved and all up I spent something like 7 hours on it. (1 hour photo shooting + 6 hours Photoshop work).</td>', 'Thanx for all the nice and helpful comments throughout this challenge. This was an idea I got after I found something similar while looking through a magazine. I changed a lot of stuff around which suited me better and adapted it to the challenge and ended up with this image. There really is quite a lot of work involved and all up I spent something like 7 hours on it. (1 hour photo shooting + 6 hours Photoshop work).', '2003-05-05 04:55:02.000000', NULL, 0);
