(287659, 19579, 3540, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another ribbon Kiwiness.  Thank god you didn''t use your 5050 so the lowest score on the 5050 page is still in my range :)  This was my only 10 of the week and I don''t think I had a 9 either.  Easily the best image in the field.  Great pic, thanks for sharing it!</td>', 'Congrats on another ribbon Kiwiness.  Thank god you didn''t use your 5050 so the lowest score on the 5050 page is still in my range :)  This was my only 10 of the week and I don''t think I had a 9 either.  Easily the best image in the field.  Great pic, thanks for sharing it!', '2003-05-05 06:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
