(287928, 19569, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo except for the characters.  It''s not real, it''s a blatantly stupid attempt to make it seem Japanese and I consider it as somewhat racist.  If you''re going to do it right, use a real character and one that actually means something, instead of just plugging in some squigly lines and thinking that it meant something.  Only people you can fool are people as ignorant as you are.<br/> <br/>It''s also an insult to Buddhists everywhere.  This is not zen.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-05 11:50:23.</i></td>', 'Nice photo except for the characters.  It''s not real, it''s a blatantly stupid attempt to make it seem Japanese and I consider it as somewhat racist.  If you''re going to do it right, use a real character and one that actually means something, instead of just plugging in some squigly lines and thinking that it meant something.  Only people you can fool are people as ignorant as you are. It''s also an insult to Buddhists everywhere.  This is not zen.', '2003-05-05 12:47:58.000000', '2003-05-05 12:50:23.000000', 0),
