(531422, 19579, 5728, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by wanderer:</b></div><hr/><i>Great photo.Would make a find wallpaper.How about writing a tutorial for the slow witted amongst us.<br/> <br/>Well done</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. A tutorial would be impossible seeing I spent about 7 hours on the post processing phase of this photo and don''t remember all the steps I took. Basically I created the film background in Photoshop and cut up the photos I took and placed them into the main image. Most of the process I did as I went, which means mainly experimenting all the time.</td>', 'Originally posted by wanderer:Great photo.Would make a find wallpaper.How about writing a tutorial for the slow witted amongst us. Well done  Thank you. A tutorial would be impossible seeing I spent about 7 hours on the post processing phase of this photo and don''t remember all the steps I took. Basically I created the film background in Photoshop and cut up the photos I took and placed them into the main image. Most of the process I did as I went, which means mainly experimenting all the time.', '2004-01-04 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
